g\u003e Tracks performance across various activities including running, cycling, and yoga.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStay Connected:\u003c\/strong\u003e Handle calls, messages, and notifications from your wrist.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant Compatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e Interact with Google Assistant or Siri.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt-In Entertainment:\u003c\/strong\u003e Includes 4 fun games like Flappy Bird and 2048.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEveryday Tools:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alarms, weather updates, flashlight, and calculator.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.19-inch AMOLED screen.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–7 days of regular use, 25–30 days on standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e Heart rate monitor, blood pressure tracker, SpO2 level measurement, sleep tracking, stress management, menstrual cycle tracking.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e 107 modes including running, cycling, yoga.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e Calls, messages, notifications, music playback, call records, find phone.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Google Assistant, Siri.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGames:\u003c\/strong\u003e 4 built-in games.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAdditional Tools:\u003c\/strong\u003e Alarms, weather updates, flashlight, calculator.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Regal Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Regal \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eis the perfect blend of sophistication and smart innovation. With its stylish design, comprehensive health tracking features, and a suite of practical and entertainment tools, it seamlessly fits into your daily life. Whether you're focused on fitness, staying organized, or just having some fun, the Regal Smartwatch is your ideal companion, ready to step into the future with you!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Copper Silver","offer_id":50270222516502,"sku":"22552","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Obsidian Gold","offer_id":50372312826134,"sku":"22554","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Rose Gold","offer_id":49685919531286,"sku":"22550","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Aqua Silver","offer_id":49685919465750,"sku":"22556","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Emerald Silver","offer_id":49685919432982,"sku":"22558","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Racing Red Silver","offer_id":49685919498518,"sku":"22548","price":18499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/CopperSilver_1.webp?v=1756127463"},{"product_id":"edge-smartwatch","title":"Edge Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eThe Edge Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStylish and Durable Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Lightweight construction (22g) with a sturdy PC+ABS finish.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVivid TFT Display:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.83-inch screen with a resolution of 240×284 pixels.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong-Lasting Battery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 7–9 days of regular use and up to 35 days on standby. Quick charging in under 2.5 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Level Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathe Training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStress Management Tools\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Burned Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eStay Connected\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManage calls, messages, and notifications directly from your wrist.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCamera Control for snapping moments.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\"Find Phone\" feature for convenience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eEveryday Tools\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlarms, weather updates, flashlight, calculator, and motion gesture for screen activation.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSedentary, drink water, and hand wash reminders.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.83-inch TFT screen with 240×284 resolution.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 7–9 days regular use, 35 days on standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Less than 2.5 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68 rating for durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOperating System:\u003c\/strong\u003e Compatible with Android 9+ and iOS 12+.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3 with 10-meter transmission range.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Edge Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Edge \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003edelivers a harmonious blend of functionality and style. With advanced health tracking, seamless connectivity, and practical everyday tools, it fits right into your lifestyle. Whether you're working, exercising, or relaxing, the Edge Smartwatch enhances every moment with its innovative features and long-lasting performance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":49894865142038,"sku":"22878","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":49894865174806,"sku":"22879","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gray","offer_id":49894865109270,"sku":"22943","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Rose Pink","offer_id":49894865240342,"sku":"22945","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red Berry","offer_id":49894865207574,"sku":"22944","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/B1_218495a9-8f36-4abf-b51a-64671c0db56e.webp?v=1767865748"},{"product_id":"striker-earbuds","title":"Striker Earbuds","description":"\u003ch1\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStriker Earbuds by Zero Lifestyle\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSleek and Dynamic Design\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCrafted for style and comfort, the Striker Earbuds are available in three bold color choices—Black, Green, and Camo.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompact Build:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds measure 34.99 × 21.15 × 24.88 mm.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePortable Charging Case:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dimensions of 60.73 × 63.96 × 42.44 mm.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLightweight:\u003c\/strong\u003e Total weight of just 48.9 g, ensuring a comfortable fit for extended use.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLong Battery Life \u0026amp; Efficient Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnjoy uninterrupted performance with a robust battery setup.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtended Playtime:\u003c\/strong\u003e Up to 27.5 hours in total, with approximately 5.5 hours of continuous playback at 70% volume.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFast Charging:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully recharges in about 2 hours via a Type-C input (1W for the case, 0.5W output).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReliable Batteries:\u003c\/strong\u003e Powered by Jingshan Yifan Energy Co., Ltd. with an earbud battery capacity of 35mAh and a case capacity of 400mAh.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStandby Duration:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds last about 60 days; charging case lasts up to 120 days.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Wireless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExperience effortless pairing and uninterrupted listening.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLatest Bluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e Equipped with \u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth V5.4\u003c\/strong\u003e for stable connections.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReliable Range:\u003c\/strong\u003e Maintains connectivity within \u003cstrong\u003e≥10 meters\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHassle-Free Pairing:\u003c\/strong\u003e Supports \u003cstrong\u003eautomatic pairing\u003c\/strong\u003e for an effortless user experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGame Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e Low-latency performance with \u003cstrong\u003e65ms response time\u003c\/strong\u003e for immersive gaming.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIntuitive Touch \u0026amp; Voice Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnjoy easy management with sensitive touch controls.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlay\/Pause:\u003c\/strong\u003e Single tap on either earbud.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCall Handling:\u003c\/strong\u003e Answer with a tap, double-tap to hang up, long press (2–3 seconds) to reject.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant Activation:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long press the \u003cstrong\u003eleft earbud\u003c\/strong\u003e (3 seconds) for Siri or Google Assistant.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGaming Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e Long press the \u003cstrong\u003eright earbud\u003c\/strong\u003e (3 seconds) for a low-latency experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFactory Reset:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tap \u003cstrong\u003efive times\u003c\/strong\u003e while pairing L \u0026amp; R, then place them in the case and remove to confirm reset.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSuperior Audio Experience\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eImmerse yourself in powerful sound clarity.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHigh-Quality Drivers:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e13mm audio drivers\u003c\/strong\u003e deliver a frequency range of \u003cstrong\u003e20Hz–20kHz\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOptimized Sensitivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003e111.5±3dB\u003c\/strong\u003e ensures balanced sound performance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eClear Calls:\u003c\/strong\u003e Equipped with a \u003cstrong\u003e2718 silicone microphone\u003c\/strong\u003e for superior voice capture.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAI ENC Technology:\u003c\/strong\u003e Enhances call noise reduction for crisp conversations.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Certified \u003cstrong\u003eIPX4\u003c\/strong\u003e for protection against splashes and light rain.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEarbud Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 34.99 × 21.15 × 24.88 mm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Case Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 60.73 × 63.96 × 42.44 mm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 48.9 g\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e About \u003cstrong\u003e2 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eV5.4\u003c\/strong\u003e, supports multiple protocols\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAudio Decoding:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eSBC\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMicrophone:\u003c\/strong\u003e Single MIC\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Control:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully responsive interface\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Includes\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStriker Earbuds (Left \u0026amp; Right)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Case\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReplaceable Eartips\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Cable\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose the Striker Earbuds?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDesigned for those who demand excellence, the Striker Earbuds by Zero Lifestyle bring together cutting-edge technology and a modern aesthetic. Whether you're making calls, gaming, or enjoying music, these earbuds are built to elevate your lifestyle.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gaming Black","offer_id":50894617641238,"sku":"24765","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gaming Camou Beige","offer_id":50938794901782,"sku":"24763","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":50050472968470,"sku":"22916","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Camou Beige","offer_id":50050472870166,"sku":"22942","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Camou Gray","offer_id":50050472902934,"sku":"22917","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gaming Camou Gray","offer_id":50938794934550,"sku":"24764","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":50050472935702,"sku":"23083","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gaming-Forest Green","offer_id":51218551669014,"sku":"24872","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/02_f028c409-29ec-4027-998a-1fc1e542b4b3.webp?v=1771065090"},{"product_id":"legacy-smartwatch","title":"Legacy Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2 data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"119\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"140\" data-start=\"119\"\u003eLegacy Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"453\" data-start=\"119\"\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"143\" data-start=\"140\"\u003eThe Legacy Smartwatch combines modern utility with timeless design, engineered to elevate your everyday life. From powerful health tracking features to customizable aesthetics, this smartwatch is built for users who demand performance, comfort, and a touch of class — whether at work, in the gym, or on the go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"483\" data-start=\"460\"\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"485\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"586\" data-start=\"485\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"586\" data-start=\"487\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"514\" data-start=\"487\"\u003eRefined \u0026amp; Robust Design\u003c\/strong\u003e: 44mm zinc alloy + plastic case, 56g weight with IP67 water resistance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"587\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"589\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"615\" data-start=\"589\"\u003eVibrant AMOLED Display\u003c\/strong\u003e: Sharp visuals on a 1.39\" screen with brightness adjustment and always-on support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"800\" data-start=\"699\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"800\" data-start=\"701\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"729\" data-start=\"701\"\u003eLong Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5–7 days of regular use, 25–30 days standby with a quick 2-hour charge.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"801\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"839\" data-start=\"803\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"838\" data-start=\"803\"\u003eComprehensive Health Monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"842\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"842\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"844\"\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"870\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"872\"\u003eBlood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"900\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"925\" data-start=\"902\"\u003eSpO2 Level Monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"946\" data-start=\"928\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"946\" data-start=\"930\"\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"949\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"951\"\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1003\" data-start=\"980\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1003\" data-start=\"982\"\u003eBreathing Exercises\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"1006\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"1008\"\u003eCalorie Tracker\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1113\" data-start=\"1026\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1113\" data-start=\"1028\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"1028\"\u003e120+ Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e: Covers activities from running and cycling to yoga and beyond.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1215\" data-start=\"1114\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1215\" data-start=\"1116\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1139\" data-start=\"1116\"\u003eSmart Notifications\u003c\/strong\u003e: Stay updated with call alerts, messages, reminders, and app notifications.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1308\" data-start=\"1216\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1308\" data-start=\"1218\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1249\" data-start=\"1218\"\u003eVoice Assistant Integration\u003c\/strong\u003e: Compatible with voice assistants for hands-free commands.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1406\" data-start=\"1309\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1406\" data-start=\"1311\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1338\" data-start=\"1311\"\u003eInteractive Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e: 13 dynamic faces, including 6 animated and full DIY customization.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1478\" data-start=\"1407\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1478\" data-start=\"1409\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1409\"\u003eEntertainment on Wrist\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1 built-in game (\"Plane\") for quick play.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"1479\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1608\" data-start=\"1481\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1501\" data-start=\"1481\"\u003eDaily Essentials\u003c\/strong\u003e: Alarm, weather, flashlight, calculator, sedentary reminder, drink water prompt, camera control, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"1644\" data-start=\"1615\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1701\" data-start=\"1648\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1659\" data-start=\"1648\"\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e: AMOLED, 1.39-inch, brightness adjustable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1741\" data-start=\"1702\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1741\" data-start=\"1704\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1715\" data-start=\"1704\"\u003eBattery\u003c\/strong\u003e: 400mAh lithium battery\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1742\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1744\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1758\" data-start=\"1744\"\u003eUsage Time\u003c\/strong\u003e: 5–7 days regular, 25–30 days standby\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1845\" data-start=\"1799\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1845\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1813\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003eCharging\u003c\/strong\u003e: 2 hours via magnetic suction\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1932\" data-start=\"1846\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1932\" data-start=\"1848\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1859\" data-start=\"1848\"\u003eSensors\u003c\/strong\u003e: Heart rate (HRS3605), SpO2, Blood pressure, Accelerometer (LIS2DOCTR)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1980\" data-start=\"1933\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1980\" data-start=\"1935\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1951\" data-start=\"1935\"\u003eSports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e: 120+ activities supported\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2067\" data-start=\"1981\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2067\" data-start=\"1983\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1999\" data-start=\"1983\"\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Bluetooth 5.2, 20m range, supports calls, contacts, call records\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2126\" data-start=\"2068\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2126\" data-start=\"2070\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2089\" data-start=\"2070\"\u003eVoice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e: Google Assistant, Siri compatible\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2152\" data-start=\"2127\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2152\" data-start=\"2129\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2138\" data-start=\"2129\"\u003eGames\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1 built-in\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2265\" data-start=\"2153\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2265\" data-start=\"2155\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2170\" data-start=\"2155\"\u003eOther Tools\u003c\/strong\u003e: Flashlight, alarm, weather, calculator, camera control, DND mode, motion gesture activation\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"2266\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2296\" data-start=\"2268\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2288\" data-start=\"2268\"\u003eWater Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e: IP67\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"2340\" data-start=\"2303\"\u003eWhy Choose the Legacy Smartwatch?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2688\" data-start=\"2342\"\u003eThe Legacy \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003eis more than just a wearable — it’s a lifestyle upgrade. Designed with precision, equipped with cutting-edge features, and built to last, it’s the perfect companion for health tracking, productivity, and staying connected. Whether you're chasing goals or winding down, Legacy adapts to your day — strong, smart, and stylish.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gold Black","offer_id":50200306778390,"sku":"20778","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":50200306745622,"sku":"20779","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver Blue","offer_id":50200306811158,"sku":"22173","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/GoldBlack_2.webp?v=1765658265"},{"product_id":"snap-zbuds","title":"Snap Zbuds","description":"\u003ch3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"20\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"18\"\u003eSnap Zbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"22\" data-end=\"306\"\u003eThe Snap Zbuds are engineered for music lovers and multitaskers who want powerful sound, effortless controls, and all-day comfort. With immersive audio, long-lasting battery, and seamless connectivity, Snap Zbuds are your go-to earbuds for work, workouts, and everything in between.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"311\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"346\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"344\"\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"454\"\u003e🎧 \u003cstrong data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"383\"\u003eCompact \u0026amp; Lightweight Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – Ergonomic earbuds with a sleek charging case for easy portability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"560\"\u003e🔊 \u003cstrong data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"478\"\u003eImmersive Audio\u003c\/strong\u003e – 12 mm dynamic drivers with SBC and AAC decoding deliver rich, balanced sound.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"681\"\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"590\"\u003eExtended Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – Up to \u003cstrong data-start=\"599\" data-end=\"610\"\u003e7 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e of playtime on a single charge and \u003cstrong data-start=\"646\" data-end=\"664\"\u003e29 hours total\u003c\/strong\u003e with the case.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"778\"\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"716\"\u003eQuick Charging \u0026amp; USB‑C Port\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fully charges in \u003cstrong data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"747\"\u003e2 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e for uninterrupted listening.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"891\"\u003e🔗 \u003cstrong data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"808\"\u003eSeamless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bluetooth 5.3 with 10 m range, quick auto‑pairing, and master‑slave switching.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"1023\"\u003e🎙 \u003cstrong data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"920\"\u003eClear Calls Anywhere\u003c\/strong\u003e – Dual MEMS microphones with ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation) for crystal‑clear conversations.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1148\"\u003e🖐 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1064\"\u003eTouch Controls \u0026amp; Voice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e – Play\/pause, switch tracks, and activate Siri\/Google Assistant with simple taps.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1224\"\u003e💧 \u003cstrong data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1179\"\u003eIPX4 Splash Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Built to withstand sweat and light rain.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1229\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1266\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1264\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1986\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1319\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1319\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1270\" data-end=\"1292\"\u003eEarbud Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 27.39 × 25.01 × 23.02 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1320\" data-end=\"1371\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1371\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1322\" data-end=\"1351\"\u003eCharging Case Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 66 × 43.7 × 32 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1372\" data-end=\"1395\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1395\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1385\"\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 30.42 g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1455\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1455\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1419\"\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 50 mAh (earbuds) + 480 mAh (case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1456\" data-end=\"1516\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1516\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1471\"\u003ePlaytime:\u003c\/strong\u003e 7 hours (single charge) \/ 29 hours (total)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1547\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1547\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1536\"\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 70 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1588\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1588\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1568\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2 hours via USB‑C\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1632\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1632\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1613\"\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3 (10 m range)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1659\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1659\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1647\"\u003eChipset:\u003c\/strong\u003e Jieli7016\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1702\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1702\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1679\"\u003eAudio Driver:\u003c\/strong\u003e 12 mm dynamic driver\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1703\" data-end=\"1745\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1745\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1705\" data-end=\"1728\"\u003eFrequency Response:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20 Hz – 20 kHz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1769\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1769\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1762\"\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/strong\u003e 16 Ω\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1803\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1803\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1772\" data-end=\"1788\"\u003eSensitivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 112.5 ± 3 dB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1838\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1838\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1806\" data-end=\"1827\"\u003eDecoding Support:\u003c\/strong\u003e SBC, AAC\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1873\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1873\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1841\" data-end=\"1857\"\u003eMicrophones:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dual MEMS Mic\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1874\" data-end=\"1940\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1940\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1899\"\u003eNoise Cancellation:\u003c\/strong\u003e ENC (Environmental Noise Cancellation)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1986\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1986\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1964\"\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IPX4 (splash‑proof)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"1991\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1993\" data-end=\"2025\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1997\" data-end=\"2023\"\u003eWhy Choose Snap Zbuds?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2027\" data-end=\"2409\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eSnap Zbuds are more than just wireless earbuds—they’re your all‑day companion for calls, music, and workouts. With powerful audio, reliable ENC for clear calls, and a compact design, they’re built for every moment. Whether you’re commuting, hitting the gym, or just unwinding, Snap Zbuds keep you connected and entertained without compromise.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Lavender Haze","offer_id":50335110660374,"sku":"23427","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Cool Grey","offer_id":50335110627606,"sku":"23425","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pearl White","offer_id":50335110693142,"sku":"23426","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Lavendar-Haze_2.webp?v=1771238203"},{"product_id":"luna-pro","title":"Luna Pro","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLuna Pro Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Luna Pro Smartwatch blends modern design with powerful health and lifestyle features, delivering a premium experience for everyday life. With advanced sensors, fitness tracking, and a customizable interface, Luna Pro keeps you connected, informed, and in control—wherever your day takes you.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⌚ \u003cstrong\u003ePremium Build Quality\u003c\/strong\u003e – Zinc alloy middle frame with PC plastic bottom case and anti-static z\u003cspan\u003einc alloy frame\u003c\/span\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🖥 \u003cstrong\u003eVibrant Display\u003c\/strong\u003e – 1.38-inch TFT round screen with 240×240 resolution and full-screen touch support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong\u003eReliable Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – 220 mAh polymer battery provides \u003cstrong\u003e5–7 days of regular use\u003c\/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e10–15 days standby\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong\u003eFast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fully charges in \u003cstrong\u003e2.5–3 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e via magnetic USB cable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e📱 \u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bluetooth 5.3 with call support, notifications, music control, and remote camera function.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e❤️ \u003cstrong\u003eComprehensive Health Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e –\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring (LC09 Sensor)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlood Oxygen (SpO2)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSleep Monitoring (22:00–8:00)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBreathing Exercises\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🏃 \u003cstrong\u003eFitness \u0026amp; Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e – Supports walking, running, cycling, skipping rope, basketball, soccer, badminton, and swimming, with GPS motion tracking via the \u003cstrong\u003eDaFit app\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🎨 \u003cstrong\u003eCustomizable Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e – 4 pre-installed dials, 1 DIY custom face, and more available in the watch face market.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🧠 \u003cstrong\u003eSmart Assistant \u0026amp; Tools\u003c\/strong\u003e – AI voice assistant, alarm, calculator, stopwatch, weather updates, sedentary and drink reminders, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e💧 \u003cstrong\u003eWaterproof Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – \u003cstrong\u003eIP68 water resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e, making it safe for daily use and light water exposure.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Zinc alloy frame + PC bottom + silicone strap\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.38-inch TFT, 240×240 resolution, full-touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChipset:\u003c\/strong\u003e JIELI 7012F6\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMemory:\u003c\/strong\u003e RAM 640 KB \/ ROM 64 MB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSensors:\u003c\/strong\u003e LC09 heart rate sensor, Minghao DA267 G-sensor\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 220 mAh polymer battery (5–7 days use, 10–15 days standby)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2.5–3 hours magnetic charging\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3, supports calls, music control, notifications\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Walking, running, cycling, skipping rope, basketball, soccer, badminton, swimming\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApp:\u003c\/strong\u003e DaFit (Android 5.0 + \/ iOS 9.0 +)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtra Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e AI voice assistant, remote camera, DIY watch face, split‑screen, built‑in game, OTA updates\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose Luna Pro Smartwatch?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Luna Pro Smartwatch is designed for users who demand performance, style, and versatility. From \u003cstrong\u003ehealth monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e to \u003cstrong\u003esmartphone connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e, it combines everyday convenience with fitness intelligence. With customizable watch faces, extended battery life, and IP68 water resistance, Luna Pro is more than a smartwatch—it’s your all‑day companion for work, workouts, and everything in between.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":50337766244630,"sku":"23118","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":50337766277398,"sku":"23120","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/BLACKWATCHFACE.webp?v=1755331884"},{"product_id":"lunar-360-smartwatch","title":"Lunar 360 Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003eLunar 360 Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eLunar 360 Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e combines cutting-edge technology with a sleek modern design, giving you the ultimate balance of style, performance, and wellness. With its high-resolution AMOLED display, extended battery life, and advanced health monitoring, Lunar 360 is built to keep up with your lifestyle—day and night.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⌚ \u003cstrong\u003ePremium Build Quality\u003c\/strong\u003e – Zinc alloy electroplated middle frame, stainless steel dual buttons, and ABS+PC bottom shell with leather-TPU strap.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🖥 \u003cstrong\u003eBrilliant AMOLED Display\u003c\/strong\u003e – 1.43-inch AMOLED round screen with 466×466 resolution and full-screen touch functionality.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong\u003ePowerful Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e – 300 mAh polymer lithium battery offering:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e10 days of typical use\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e30 days standby\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3 days in AOD (Always-On Display) mode\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong\u003eMagnetic Fast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – Convenient magnetic charging method for quick and reliable power-ups.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e📱 \u003cstrong\u003eAdvanced Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bluetooth 5.3 with call support, music control, notifications, and remote camera functionality.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e❤️ \u003cstrong\u003eComprehensive Health Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e –\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring (VC30F-S Sensor)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlood Oxygen (SpO2)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSleep Monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBreathing Exercises\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🏃 \u003cstrong\u003eFitness \u0026amp; Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e – Multiple sport profiles supported, including running, cycling, walking, and more, with motion tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🎨 \u003cstrong\u003eCustomizable Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e – AMOLED display supports vibrant pre-installed dials and downloadable options via companion app.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🧠 \u003cstrong\u003eSmart Tools \u0026amp; Assistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Voice assistant, weather, calendar, alarm, stopwatch, timer, calculator, world clock, sedentary \u0026amp; drink reminders.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e💧 \u003cstrong\u003eWaterproof Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – IP67 water resistance ensures safety in daily use and light water exposure.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Zinc alloy middle frame, stainless steel buttons, ABS+PC bottom shell, leather+TPU strap\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.43-inch AMOLED, 466×466 resolution, full-touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChipset:\u003c\/strong\u003e RTL8773EWE-VP\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMemory:\u003c\/strong\u003e SRAM 560 KB, PSRAM 4 MB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFlash:\u003c\/strong\u003e 128 Mbit\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSensors:\u003c\/strong\u003e VC30F-S heart rate \u0026amp; SpO₂ sensor, STK8321 G-sensor\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 300 mAh polymer lithium (10 days use, 30 days standby, 3 days AOD mode)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging:\u003c\/strong\u003e Magnetic charging\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3 (with call support, notifications, music, and more)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 65 g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 53.2 × 46.5 × 12.8 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP67\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtras:\u003c\/strong\u003e Voice assistant, remote camera, breathing exercises, business card holder, OTA software updates\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eWhy Choose Lunar 360 Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Lunar 360 \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart watch\u003c\/a\u003e is more than just a wearable—it’s a complete lifestyle companion. Whether you want to stay on top of your health, boost your productivity, or enjoy seamless connectivity, Lunar 360 delivers it all in a stylish, durable package. With its AMOLED display, customizable watch faces, long battery life, and IP67 water resistance, it’s built for those who demand performance, sophistication, and reliability every day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Brown Leather","offer_id":50407371014422,"sku":"23159","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Gold Silicone","offer_id":50407370850582,"sku":"23162","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Silicone","offer_id":50407370981654,"sku":"23161","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Leather","offer_id":50407370948886,"sku":"23157","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Green Leather","offer_id":50407371079958,"sku":"23160","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey Silver Silicone","offer_id":50407371047190,"sku":"23164","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Green Silicone","offer_id":50407371112726,"sku":"23165","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Silicone","offer_id":50407370916118,"sku":"23163","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Leather","offer_id":50407370883350,"sku":"23158","price":13999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/lunar_Brown-Leather_1.webp?v=1756987036"},{"product_id":"visionary-smartwatch","title":"Visionary Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Contains\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e1 × ZERO Visionary Smartwatch\u003cbr\u003e1 × User Manual\u003cbr\u003e1 × Warranty Card\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eZERO Visionary Smartwatch\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe ZERO Visionary Smartwatch combines cutting-edge technology with a sleek modern design, giving you the ultimate balance of style, performance, and wellness. With its high-resolution AMOLED display, extended battery life, and advanced health monitoring, Visionary is built to keep up with your lifestyle day and night.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBrilliant AMOLED Display:\u003cbr\u003e1.85-inch AMOLED HD full-touch screen with stunning clarity and vibrant visuals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSeamless Bluetooth Calling*  Single-chip Bluetooth 5.3 delivers stable, clear call quality directly from your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e*Customizable Watch Faces* Switch between built-in dials or cloud-based designs to suit your mood and style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e *Comprehensive Health Tracking*  Real-time heart rate monitoring, SpO₂ tracking, sleep analysis, and female health tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e *Fitness \u0026amp; Sports Modes* Multiple workout profiles supported for accurate performance and activity tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Notifications \u0026amp; Controls \u003c\/strong\u003eStay updated with instant alerts and manage music, camera, and weather with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIP68 Water Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e  Designed to handle sweat, rain, and splashes for worry-free daily wear.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePowerful Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Up to 15 days of typical use on a single charge for uninterrupted performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.85-inch AMOLED HD, full-touch screen\u003cbr\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.3 (with call support, notifications, music, and camera control)\u003cbr\u003eHealth Sensors: Heart rate, SpO₂, sleep tracking, female health monitoring\u003cbr\u003eSports: Multiple sport modes with motion tracking\u003cbr\u003eWater Resistance: IP68\u003cbr\u003eBattery Life: Up to 15 days\u003cbr\u003eCharging: Magnetic charging cable\u003cbr\u003eBuild: Stylish, durable design with premium finish\u003cbr\u003eWarranty: 365 Days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy Choose ZERO Visionary?\u003cbr\u003eThe ZERO Visionary \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart watch in Pakistan\u003c\/a\u003e is more than just a wearable it’s your complete lifestyle companion. Whether you want to track your health, boost productivity, or enjoy seamless connectivity, Visionary delivers it all in a stylish, durable package. With its AMOLED display, customizable watch faces, long battery life, and IP68 water resistance, it’s designed for those who demand performance, sophistication, and reliability every day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Starlight Silicone","offer_id":50583080632598,"sku":"22948","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Silicone","offer_id":50583080435990,"sku":"22947","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Brown Silicone","offer_id":50583080501526,"sku":"22949","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Rainbow","offer_id":50583080599830,"sku":"22950","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Olive Green Silicone","offer_id":50583080534294,"sku":"22946","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Leather","offer_id":50583080468758,"sku":"22951","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Orange Silicone","offer_id":50583080567062,"sku":"22952","price":10999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Visionary_Starlight-Silicone_1_a7706397-974f-479a-9934-13ea5327f478.webp?v=1774870143"},{"product_id":"evo-earbuds","title":"Evo Earbuds","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEVO Earbuds\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe EVO Earbuds bring a bold new edge to sound and style. With a sleek metallic finish, powerful 10 mm drivers, and dual-mic ENC for crystal-clear calls, EVO is designed for those who live loud and make every beat their own. Built to match Gen Z energy, it’s where performance meets personality.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePremium Metallic Design – Glossy metallic casing with bold color options. \u003cbr\u003eLightweight 36.5 g build for everyday comfort and portability.\u003cbr\u003ePowerful Sound Performance – 10 mm dynamic drivers deliver balanced bass and crisp treble.\u003cbr\u003eENC Voice Clarity – Dual-mic Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC) ensures clear calls even in noisy environments.\u003cbr\u003eBattery Performance –\u003cbr\u003eEarbuds: 40 mAh each (approx. 5–6 hours playtime)\u003cbr\u003eUp to 50 Hours total play time.\u003cbr\u003eCharging Type – Type C\u003cbr\u003eBluetooth Connectivity – Bluetooth 5.4 \u003cbr\u003eSmart Touch Controls –\u003cbr\u003ePlay\/Pause: Single-tap MFB button\u003cbr\u003eNext Track: Double-tap right earbud\u003cbr\u003ePrevious Track: Double-tap left earbud\u003cbr\u003eVolume +: Triple-tap left earbud\u003cbr\u003eVolume –: Triple-tap right earbud\u003cbr\u003eVoice Assistant (Siri \/ Google): Press and hold 2 s\u003cbr\u003eAnswer \/ Hang up Call: Single-tap MFB\u003cbr\u003eReject Call: Long-press 2 s MFB\u003cbr\u003eTurn Off: Press and hold 4 s\u003cbr\u003eWater Resistance – IPX4 Water Resistance\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging Case Dimensions: 60.1 × 48.36 × 26.6 mm\u003cbr\u003eWeight: 36.5 g (total)\u003cbr\u003eBattery Capacity: Earbuds 40 mAh each \/ Case 400 mAh\u003cbr\u003eTotal Playtime: 50 hours\u003cbr\u003eBluetooth Version: 5.4 \u003cbr\u003eBluetooth Range: 10 m\u003cbr\u003eDriver Size: 10 mm dynamic drivers\u003cbr\u003eMicrophones: Dual mic + ENC \u003cbr\u003eControls: Smart Touch (MFB multi-function buttons)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose EVO Earbuds?\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe EVO Earbuds are engineered for those who thrive on individuality. With their metallic build, punchy 10 mm drivers, and ENC-enhanced voice clarity, EVO ensures your music and calls always sound as good as you look. Designed for expressive, everyday use. It’s not just another pair of earbuds, it’s your sound, your style, your EVO.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":50630768132374,"sku":"23463","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Milky White","offer_id":50630768197910,"sku":"23470","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":50630768165142,"sku":"23464","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Ruby Red","offer_id":50630768230678,"sku":"23468","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":50630768099606,"sku":"23466","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/evo_jet-back_3.webp?v=1776686260"},{"product_id":"aero-earbuds","title":"Aero Earbuds","description":"\u003ch2 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero Z-Buds\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePackage Contains:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 1 pair of \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/earbuds-zbuds\"\u003eearbud\u003c\/a\u003e, 1 charging cable, 1 user manual, 1 feature book, 1 warranty card\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero Z-Buds\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero brings the essence of Zero Lifestyle’s sound engineering into a lighter, more compact form. Designed for creators, commuters, and everyday listeners, Aero delivers studio-grade clarity, seamless connectivity, and comfort that stays with you all day. Whether you’re in the zone, on the go, or winding down, Aero blends performance and elegance for the modern audio experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e13mm Boosted Super Driver\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero is powered by a 13mm boosted sound driver that enhances every beat with rich depth and crisp detail, creating a balanced audio experience that brings your playlists, calls, and podcasts to life.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eENC Function with Quad Mic\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWith Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC) and a Quad Mic setup, Aero ensures your voice stays crystal clear during calls, even in noisy surroundings. Ideal for remote work, content creation, and everyday communication.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAI Voice Assistant\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIntegrated AI voice support lets you control music, manage calls, and check updates effortlessly, all through simple voice commands without reaching for your phone.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eLow Latency Gaming Mode\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWith just \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e45ms latency\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, Aero’s gaming mode synchronizes sound and visuals in real-time for uninterrupted gameplay and a competitive edge.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInstant Pairing\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero connects instantly the moment you open the case; no delays, no manual reconnecting. Smart pairing technology remembers your devices for a seamless start every time.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExtended Battery Life\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEnjoy \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eup to 30 hours of total playtime\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e (including case) and \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e5 hours on a single charge\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, supported by Type-C fast charging that gives \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e120 minutes of playtime in just 10 minutes\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIPX5 Water Resistance\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBuilt to handle splashes, sweat, and light rain, Aero keeps up with your workouts and outdoor routines without compromise.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSensitive Touch Controls\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eManage music, calls, and gaming mode with a gentle tap; intuitive touch control ensures zero interruptions in your flow.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 5.4\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBT Range:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 15m\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpeaker Unit:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 13mm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFrequency Response:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 20–10kHz\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 32Ω\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEarbud Battery:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 30mAh\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCharging Case Battery:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 250mAh\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 1.5 hours\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlaytime:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Up to 5 hours on a single charge; 30 hours total with case\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCharging Input:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Type-C, DC 5V 0.3A\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBox Input:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e DC 5V 0.3A\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e IPX5\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecial Features:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e 13mm boosted drivers, ENC with Quad Mic, AI Voice Assistant, Gaming Mode (45ms Low Latency), Instant Pairing, Type-C Fast Charging, 10-min quick charge = 120-min playtime, IPX5 water resistance, Sensitive Touch Controls\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhy Choose Aero Z-Buds\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAero Z-Buds redefine what everyday audio should feel effortless, expressive, and reliable. With immersive sound, powerful noise cancellation, and long-lasting performance, Aero keeps you connected to your rhythm wherever life takes you. From daily commutes to late-night edits, from workouts to work calls, Aero delivers clarity, comfort, and confidence, the Zero way.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Hyper Red","offer_id":51198922490134,"sku":"22281","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":51198932222230,"sku":"22270","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Space White","offer_id":51198931665174,"sku":"23064","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Aqua Green","offer_id":51198923211030,"sku":"23063","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":51198931730710,"sku":"23061","price":3499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Aero_Hyper-Red-4.webp?v=1766759359"},{"product_id":"navigator-smartwatch","title":"Navigator Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch3 data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"351\"\u003eNavigator Smartwatch – Precision GPS. Rugged Performance.\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"704\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"381\"\u003eNavigator \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart watch\u003c\/a\u003e is built for people who take accuracy seriously — from outdoor explorers to everyday athletes. With \u003cstrong data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"504\"\u003ehigh-precision GPS\u003c\/strong\u003e, advanced health sensors, and a \u003cstrong data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"563\"\u003eworking rotating crown\u003c\/strong\u003e for ultra-smooth control, Navigator gives you powerful performance in a tough, outdoor-ready design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"704\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"relative inline-flex items-center\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003eSpec - Navigator\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"709\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"748\"\u003e🔭 High-Precision GPS Tracking\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"889\"\u003eGo further with confidence. Navigator’s \u003cstrong data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"827\"\u003eintegrated high-precision GPS chip\u003c\/strong\u003e tracks your route, pace, and distance with accuracy across:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"976\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"901\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"901\"\u003eWalking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"913\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"913\"\u003eRunning\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"925\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"925\"\u003eCycling\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"943\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"943\"\u003eTrail running\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"976\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"976\"\u003eHiking \/ on-foot exploration\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"1016\"\u003eNo phone needed for location tracking.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1021\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1070\"\u003e🎛 Working Rotating Crown + Sport Button\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1104\"\u003eNavigate your watch like a pro:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1307\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1105\" data-end=\"1175\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1175\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1125\"\u003eRotating crown\u003c\/strong\u003e to scroll menus, switch tiles, and zoom quickly\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1176\" data-end=\"1247\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1247\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1178\" data-end=\"1209\"\u003eDedicated Sport Mode button\u003c\/strong\u003e for one-tap access to your workouts\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1307\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1307\"\u003eExtra \u003cstrong data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1271\"\u003eHome button\u003c\/strong\u003e for fast control in any situation\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1400\"\u003eEven with gloves or sweaty hands, the physical controls keep everything under your command.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1402\" data-end=\"1405\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1454\"\u003e🌈 290+ Watch Faces \u0026amp; Full Customisation\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1477\"\u003eMake it truly yours:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1520\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1520\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1518\"\u003e5 default watch faces on the watch\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1582\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1582\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1559\"\u003eOver 290+ additional watch faces\u003c\/strong\u003e available in the app\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1646\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1646\"\u003eDIY custom dials using your own photos, colours, and styles\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1648\" data-end=\"1702\"\u003eYou can switch looks from sporty to formal in seconds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1704\" data-end=\"1707\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1755\"\u003e⚡ Magnetic Charging \u0026amp; Long Battery Life\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1756\" data-end=\"1820\"\u003eCharging is effortless with the \u003cstrong data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1817\"\u003eincluded magnetic charger\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1821\" data-end=\"1882\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1882\"\u003eSimply snap the charger to the back – no ports, no hassle\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1944\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1944\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1903\"\u003e300mAh battery\u003c\/strong\u003e with up to \u003cstrong data-start=\"1915\" data-end=\"1942\"\u003e3–5 days of typical use\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1945\" data-end=\"1980\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1947\" data-end=\"1980\"\u003eUp to \u003cstrong data-start=\"1953\" data-end=\"1978\"\u003e10–12 days on standby\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003eFull charge in about \u003cstrong data-start=\"2004\" data-end=\"2019\"\u003e2.5–3 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2021\" data-end=\"2024\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2026\" data-end=\"2070\"\u003e🧠 Advanced Health \u0026amp; Fitness Tracking\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2071\" data-end=\"2123\"\u003eStay on top of your health with precision sensors:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2378\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2124\" data-end=\"2154\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2126\" data-end=\"2154\"\u003e24\/7 heart rate monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2155\" data-end=\"2187\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2187\"\u003eBlood oxygen (SpO2) tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2188\" data-end=\"2226\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2226\"\u003eBlood pressure \u0026amp; stress monitoring\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2227\" data-end=\"2259\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2259\"\u003eSleep tracking with insights\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2260\" data-end=\"2307\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2307\"\u003eBreath training modes (Relax \/ Fall asleep)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2308\" data-end=\"2378\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2378\"\u003e100+ sports modes with detailed metrics (steps, kcal, duration, MET)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2383\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2385\" data-end=\"2427\"\u003e🖥 1.43\" AMOLED Display + Always-On\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2428\" data-end=\"2502\"\u003eEnjoy a vivid, sharp view with a \u003cstrong data-start=\"2461\" data-end=\"2499\"\u003e1.43-inch AMOLED display (466×466)\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2603\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2503\" data-end=\"2535\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2505\" data-end=\"2535\"\u003eAlways-On Display clock mode\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2558\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2558\"\u003eFull touch control\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2603\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2561\" data-end=\"2603\"\u003eCrisp, bright visuals indoors and outdoors\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2605\" data-end=\"2608\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2610\" data-end=\"2658\"\u003e📞 Smart Features That Keep You Connected\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2988\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2659\" data-end=\"2714\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2661\" data-end=\"2714\"\u003eBluetooth calling (dial\/answer\/reject on the watch)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2768\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2768\"\u003eApp notifications (social apps, SMS, calls, etc.)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2769\" data-end=\"2791\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2771\" data-end=\"2791\"\u003eAI voice assistant\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2792\" data-end=\"2843\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2843\"\u003eWeather, alarms, timers, stopwatch, world clock\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2906\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2846\" data-end=\"2906\"\u003eSedentary \/ drink water reminders, goal achievement alerts\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2948\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2909\" data-end=\"2948\"\u003eRemote camera shutter \u0026amp; music control\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"2949\" data-end=\"2988\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2951\" data-end=\"2988\"\u003eFind my phone, DND \u0026amp; low power mode\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2990\" data-end=\"2993\"\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"2995\" data-end=\"3016\"\u003e💧 Built Tough\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3175\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3086\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3086\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"3019\" data-end=\"3038\"\u003eIP68 waterproof\u003c\/strong\u003e – ready for sweat, splashes, and everyday use\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3087\" data-end=\"3137\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3089\" data-end=\"3137\"\u003eAluminum alloy + ABS frame, PC base, TPU strap\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3175\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3140\" data-end=\"3175\"\u003eComfortable 60.5g wearable weight\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black Red","offer_id":50750584226070,"sku":"23043","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Green","offer_id":50750584291606,"sku":"23046","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Camou Gray","offer_id":50750584258838,"sku":"23047","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Orange","offer_id":50750584324374,"sku":"23044","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Beige","offer_id":50750584160534,"sku":"23048","price":12999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":50750584193302,"sku":"23045","price":14999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/1_d8b06a71-8b9c-4564-8344-11b83b4ca7b3.webp?v=1766048642"},{"product_id":"fusion-earbuds","title":"Fusion Earbuds","description":"\u003ch1 data-end=\"294\" data-start=\"246\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"294\" data-start=\"248\"\u003eFusion Earbuds – Pure Sound. Pure Freedom.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"638\" data-start=\"296\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong data-end=\"318\" data-start=\"300\"\u003eFusion Earbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e are engineered for listeners who want powerful sound, seamless connectivity, and an ultra-comfortable in-ear design. Built with a \u003cstrong data-end=\"484\" data-start=\"449\"\u003e13mm copper-ring dynamic driver\u003c\/strong\u003e, dual microphones, Bluetooth 5.4, and a premium ergonomic fit, Fusion delivers an audio experience where clarity, comfort, and convenience come together.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"842\" data-start=\"640\"\u003eWhether you're working out, commuting, or winding down, Fusion keeps you immersed with deep bass, crisp vocals, and stable wireless performance—all wrapped inside a sleek, pocket-friendly charging case.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"880\" data-start=\"849\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"880\" data-start=\"852\"\u003ePremium Sound Quality\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"959\" data-start=\"881\"\u003ePowered by a \u003cstrong data-end=\"932\" data-start=\"894\"\u003eΦ13mm copper-ring membrane speaker\u003c\/strong\u003e, Fusion Earbuds deliver:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"960\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"979\" data-start=\"960\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"979\" data-start=\"962\"\u003eDeep, rich bass\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"996\" data-start=\"980\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"996\" data-start=\"982\"\u003eClear vocals\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1015\" data-start=\"997\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1015\" data-start=\"999\"\u003eBalanced highs\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"1016\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"1018\"\u003e20Hz–20kHz frequency response\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1050\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1052\"\u003e117dB sensitivity for crisp, high-resolution audio\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1143\" data-start=\"1106\"\u003ePerfect for music, movies, and calls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1196\" data-start=\"1150\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"1196\" data-start=\"1153\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1196\" data-start=\"1150\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1196\" data-start=\"1153\"\u003eCrystal-Clear Calling with Dual Mics\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1341\" data-start=\"1197\"\u003eEach earbud features \u003cstrong data-end=\"1238\" data-start=\"1218\"\u003edual microphones\u003c\/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1244\"\u003enoise-reduction support\u003c\/strong\u003e, ensuring your voice stays loud and clear—even in noisy environments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1348\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1351\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1348\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1351\"\u003eBluetooth 5.4 Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1483\" data-start=\"1385\"\u003eEnjoy ultra-stable and fast connectivity with the latest \u003cstrong data-end=\"1480\" data-start=\"1442\"\u003eBluetooth 5.4 (JL 7006F4 platform)\u003c\/strong\u003e:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1691\" data-start=\"1484\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1505\" data-start=\"1484\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1505\" data-start=\"1486\"\u003e\u0026lt;1s Quick Pairing\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1542\" data-start=\"1506\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1542\" data-start=\"1508\"\u003eAuto Pairing on opening the case\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1568\" data-start=\"1543\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1568\" data-start=\"1545\"\u003ePopup Pairing support\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1605\" data-start=\"1569\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1605\" data-start=\"1571\"\u003eHyper Sync for instant reconnect\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1605\" data-start=\"1569\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1605\" data-start=\"1571\"\u003e10m wireless transmission range\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1691\" data-start=\"1643\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1691\" data-start=\"1645\"\u003eSupports AVRCP, HFP, HSP, A2DP audio protocols\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1731\" data-start=\"1698\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"1731\" data-start=\"1701\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1731\" data-start=\"1698\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1731\" data-start=\"1701\"\u003eAll-Day Listening Power\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1798\" data-start=\"1732\"\u003eFusion keeps up with your routine thanks to strong battery life:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2043\" data-start=\"1799\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1836\" data-start=\"1799\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1836\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1814\" data-start=\"1801\"\u003e5.5 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e continuous playback\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1861\" data-start=\"1837\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1861\" data-start=\"1839\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1851\" data-start=\"1839\"\u003e90 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e standby\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1891\" data-start=\"1862\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1891\" data-start=\"1864\"\u003eEarbud battery: \u003cstrong data-end=\"1889\" data-start=\"1880\"\u003e40mAh\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1929\" data-start=\"1892\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1929\" data-start=\"1894\"\u003eCharging case battery: \u003cstrong data-end=\"1927\" data-start=\"1917\"\u003e400mAh\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1965\" data-start=\"1930\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1965\" data-start=\"1932\"\u003eFull charge time: \u003cstrong data-end=\"1963\" data-start=\"1950\"\u003e1.5 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1990\" data-start=\"1966\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1990\" data-start=\"1968\"\u003eType-C fast charging\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2024\" data-start=\"1991\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2024\" data-start=\"1993\"\u003eCharging case input: \u003cstrong data-end=\"2022\" data-start=\"2014\"\u003e1.5W\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2043\" data-start=\"2025\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2043\" data-start=\"2027\"\u003eOutput: \u003cstrong data-end=\"2043\" data-start=\"2035\"\u003e0.2W\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2082\" data-start=\"2050\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2082\" data-start=\"2053\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2082\" data-start=\"2050\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2082\" data-start=\"2053\"\u003eIPX4 Splash Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2168\" data-start=\"2083\"\u003eDesigned to handle sweat and light rain—ideal for workouts, commuting, and daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2204\" data-start=\"2175\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2204\" data-start=\"2178\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2204\" data-start=\"2175\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2204\" data-start=\"2178\"\u003eComfort Meets Style\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2361\" data-start=\"2205\"\u003eFusion Earbuds feature a lightweight TWS in-ear design that fits securely without fatigue.\u003cbr data-end=\"2298\" data-start=\"2295\"\u003eAvailable in premium colors:\u003cbr data-end=\"2329\" data-start=\"2326\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2361\" data-start=\"2329\"\u003eSilver, Red, Black, Gray\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2376\" data-start=\"2363\"\u003eDimensions:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2478\" data-start=\"2377\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2409\" data-start=\"2377\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2409\" data-start=\"2379\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2391\" data-start=\"2379\"\u003eEarbuds:\u003c\/strong\u003e 23 × 25 × 29 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2452\" data-start=\"2410\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2452\" data-start=\"2412\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2430\" data-start=\"2412\"\u003eCharging Case:\u003c\/strong\u003e 57 × 55.5 × 34.5 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2478\" data-start=\"2453\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2478\" data-start=\"2455\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2472\" data-start=\"2455\"\u003eTotal Weight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 46g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2509\" data-start=\"2485\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2509\" data-start=\"2488\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2509\" data-start=\"2485\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2509\" data-start=\"2488\"\u003eSmart Features\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2544\" data-start=\"2510\"\u003eFusion is built for convenience:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2761\" data-start=\"2545\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2577\" data-start=\"2545\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2577\" data-start=\"2547\"\u003eWake Siri \/ Google Assistant\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2622\" data-start=\"2578\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2622\" data-start=\"2580\"\u003eTouch controls (play\/pause, skip, calls)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2655\" data-start=\"2623\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2655\" data-start=\"2625\"\u003eCharging \u0026amp; status indicators\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2682\" data-start=\"2656\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2682\" data-start=\"2658\"\u003eMaster-slave switching\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2703\" data-start=\"2683\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2703\" data-start=\"2685\"\u003eAnti-loss prompt\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2761\" data-start=\"2704\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2761\" data-start=\"2706\"\u003eIn-ear detection (not supported—can remove if needed)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2793\" data-start=\"2768\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2793\" data-start=\"2771\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2793\" data-start=\"2768\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2793\" data-start=\"2771\"\u003eWhat’s Included\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2938\" data-start=\"2794\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2819\" data-start=\"2794\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2819\" data-start=\"2796\"\u003eFusion Earbuds (GM06)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2845\" data-start=\"2820\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2845\" data-start=\"2822\"\u003eType-C Charging Cable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2861\" data-start=\"2846\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2861\" data-start=\"2848\"\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2879\" data-start=\"2862\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2879\" data-start=\"2864\"\u003eWarranty Card\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2902\" data-start=\"2880\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2902\" data-start=\"2882\"\u003eGift Box Packaging\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2919\" data-start=\"2903\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2919\" data-start=\"2905\"\u003eLogo Sticker\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2938\" data-start=\"2920\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2938\" data-start=\"2922\"\u003eWelcome Envelope\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2963\" data-start=\"2945\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2963\" data-start=\"2948\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2963\" data-start=\"2945\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2963\" data-start=\"2948\"\u003ePerfect For\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3088\" data-start=\"2964\"\u003e✔ Daily listening\u003cbr data-end=\"2984\" data-start=\"2981\"\u003e✔ Gym \u0026amp; workouts\u003cbr data-end=\"3003\" data-start=\"3000\"\u003e✔ Travel \u0026amp; commute\u003cbr data-end=\"3024\" data-start=\"3021\"\u003e✔ Online meetings \u0026amp; calls\u003cbr data-end=\"3052\" data-start=\"3049\"\u003e✔ Students, professionals \u0026amp; gamers\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":50775231463702,"sku":"23386","price":5499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Black","offer_id":50775231430934,"sku":"23388","price":5499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver Black","offer_id":50775231496470,"sku":"23391","price":5499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Red Black","offer_id":50775231398166,"sku":"23389","price":5499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/blue-black-1.webp?v=1771411142"},{"product_id":"opal-earbuds","title":"Opal ANC Earbuds","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"530\"\u003eDesigned for everyday performance and all-day comfort, these wireless earbuds deliver powerful sound, reliable connectivity, and long battery life in a sleek in-ear design. Available in \u003cstrong data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"433\"\u003eBlack, White, Green, and Blue\u003c\/strong\u003e, they combine modern style with advanced audio technology to fit seamlessly into your lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"825\"\u003ePowered by an \u003cstrong data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"564\"\u003eF11 audio unit\u003c\/strong\u003e and supporting \u003cstrong data-start=\"580\" data-end=\"606\"\u003eSBC\/AAC audio decoding\u003c\/strong\u003e, the earbuds produce clear highs, balanced mids, and deep bass for music, calls, and streaming. With \u003cstrong data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"725\"\u003eBluetooth 5.4\u003c\/strong\u003e, you get faster pairing, stable connections, and low power consumption for uninterrupted listening.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"1105\"\u003eBuilt for convenience, the earbuds feature \u003cstrong data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"898\"\u003esensitive touch controls\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"916\"\u003eauto pairing\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"950\"\u003eindependent earbud usage\u003c\/strong\u003e with master-slave switching. Whether you’re answering calls, controlling music, or activating \u003cstrong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1073\"\u003eSiri or Google Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e, everything is just a tap away.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1333\"\u003eWith up to \u003cstrong data-start=\"1118\" data-end=\"1148\"\u003e40 hours of total playtime\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1175\"\u003eIPX4 water resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1208\"\u003elow-latency performance\u003c\/strong\u003e, these earbuds are ideal for daily use, workouts, travel, and casual gaming — offering reliable performance wherever you go.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Beige","offer_id":50996504690966,"sku":"23711","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black","offer_id":50996504658198,"sku":"23707","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Milky White","offer_id":50996504723734,"sku":"23709","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Opal_Beige-1.webp?v=1775561678"},{"product_id":"thunder-speaker","title":"Thunder Pro Speaker","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"162\" data-end=\"430\"\u003eTurn up the energy with the \u003cstrong data-start=\"190\" data-end=\"209\"\u003eThunder Speaker\u003c\/strong\u003e, built to deliver powerful sound in a compact, stylish body. Designed for music lovers who want loud, clear audio on the go, the Thunder Speaker is perfect for indoor hangouts, outdoor gatherings, and everyday listening.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"432\" data-end=\"719\"\u003eWith deep bass output, stable Bluetooth connectivity, and long-lasting battery performance, the Thunder Speaker keeps your playlists alive without interruptions. Its durable build and easy controls make it a reliable companion whether you’re chilling at home or heading out with friends.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":51000153309462,"sku":"23304","price":39999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Camou Grey","offer_id":51154395201814,"sku":"24003","price":39999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Thunder_Black01.webp?v=1774944134"},{"product_id":"bolt-pro","title":"Bolt Pro Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2 data-end=\"200\" data-start=\"160\"\u003eBolt Pro Smartwatch – Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"348\"\u003eThe ZERO BOLT PRO is a sleek and feature-rich smartwatch designed for everyday fitness, connectivity, and convenience. With its modern square dial and vibrant display, it delivers both style and smart functionality in one powerful wearable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"366\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"1365\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"451\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"451\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"394\"\u003e1.83\" IPS HD Display\u003c\/strong\u003e – Large, bright screen for clear and immersive viewing\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"539\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"539\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"487\"\u003eSingle Chip Bluetooth Calling\u003c\/strong\u003e – Make and receive calls directly from your watch\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"611\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"611\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"562\"\u003e100+ Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e – Personalize your display to match your style\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"685\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"685\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"635\"\u003e100+ Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e – Track a wide range of workouts and activities\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"750\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"750\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"721\"\u003eDynamic Heart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e – Real-time heart tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"804\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"804\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"772\"\u003eSpO₂ Monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e – Monitor blood oxygen levels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"878\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"878\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"831\"\u003eIP66 Water Resistant\u003c\/strong\u003e – Protection against dust and water splashes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"955\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"955\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"915\"\u003eQibla Direction \u0026amp; Prayer Times\u003c\/strong\u003e – Built-in Islamic lifestyle features\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1007\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1007\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"976\"\u003eTasbih Counter\u003c\/strong\u003e – Convenient digital counter\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1075\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1075\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1033\"\u003eSmart Notifications\u003c\/strong\u003e – Receive call, message, and app alerts\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1129\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1129\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1095\"\u003eSync Contacts\u003c\/strong\u003e – Easy access to saved contacts\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1182\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1182\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1159\"\u003eVoice Assistant Support\u003c\/strong\u003e – Hands-free control\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1231\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1231\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1203\"\u003eBuilt-in Games\u003c\/strong\u003e – On-the-go entertainment\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1289\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1289\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1262\"\u003eAlarm, Timer \u0026amp; Stopwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e – Everyday utility tools\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1365\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1365\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1321\"\u003eUp to 5 Days Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – Reliable performance on a single charge\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1389\"\u003eAdditional Details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1555\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1417\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1417\"\u003e3D Colorful Dynamic UI\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1439\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1439\"\u003e365 Days Warranty\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1518\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1518\"\u003eCompatible with the ZERO Health app (available on App Store \u0026amp; Google Play)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1555\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1555\"\u003eMagnetic charging cable included\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1734\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eThe ZERO BOLT PRO combines fitness tracking, smart connectivity, and practical lifestyle tools making it ideal for daily wear, workouts, and staying connected anytime, anywhere.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":51061801943318,"sku":"23892","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Vintage brown","offer_id":51068077310230,"sku":"24132","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Graphite Mauve","offer_id":51061801910550,"sku":"24136","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":51061801976086,"sku":"23813","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pearl Grey","offer_id":51061802008854,"sku":"24134","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Bolt_Black-1.webp?v=1775288200"},{"product_id":"rover-elite-earbuds","title":"Rover Elite Earbuds","description":"\u003ch2\u003eRover Elite Earbuds – Power Meets Performance\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience high-quality sound, stable connectivity, and long-lasting battery life with the Rover Elite Earbuds. Built for everyday use, these earbuds offer a perfect balance of performance and comfort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSound Quality\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEnjoy clear audio with deep bass and balanced output. With SBC and AAC support, the Rover Elite Earbuds deliver a smooth listening experience for music, calls, and videos.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe earbuds provide up to 7 hours of playtime on a single charge, with a total of up to 35 hours using the charging case. Fast charging ensures the earbuds are ready in about 45 minutes, while the case takes around 1.5 hours.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with Bluetooth 5.4, the Rover Elite Earbuds ensure a stable and fast connection with a range of over 10 meters. It also supports quick pairing and smooth device switching.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eLow Latency Mode\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith 60ms low latency, these earbuds are suitable for gaming and video streaming, keeping audio in sync with visuals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eCall Quality\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDual microphones with ENC noise reduction help reduce background noise, providing clear voice calls in different environments.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWater Resistance\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIPX4 rating makes the earbuds resistant to sweat and light splashes, making them suitable for workouts and outdoor use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eControls\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTouch controls allow you to manage music, calls, volume, and voice assistants like Siri or Google Assistant easily.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eDesign\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe earbuds feature a lightweight and ergonomic design for comfortable long-term use. Available in Beige, Blue, Green, and Black.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBox Contents\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLeft and right earbuds\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCharging cable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUser manual\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWarranty card\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUp to 35 hours total battery life\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBluetooth 5.4 connectivity\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLow latency for gaming\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eENC for clear calls\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComfortable and minimal design\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Shadow Black","offer_id":51123063783702,"sku":"24341","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Moss Green","offer_id":51123063750934,"sku":"24340","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Ivory Beige","offer_id":51123063816470,"sku":"24339","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Arctic Sky","offer_id":51123063849238,"sku":"23887","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Rover-blackk-3.webp?v=1774434409"},{"product_id":"flow-earbuds","title":"Flow Zbuds","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"138\" data-end=\"356\"\u003eThe ZERO Flow Earbuds are built for seamless audio, everyday comfort, and effortless connectivity. Designed for modern lifestyles, they deliver powerful sound, smart controls, and all-day convenience in a compact form.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-section-id=\"1sboupi\" data-start=\"363\" data-end=\"381\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"1131\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"17djwzr\" data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"462\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"410\"\u003ePremium Sound Quality\u003c\/strong\u003e – Crisp audio with deep bass and balanced clarity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1f21ur0\" data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"548\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"465\" data-end=\"484\"\u003eNoise Reduction\u003c\/strong\u003e – Reduces background noise for better focus and clearer calls\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1hwist3\" data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"632\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"577\"\u003eBluetooth Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fast, stable, and instant pairing with all devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1h7h2r3\" data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"711\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"653\"\u003eTouch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Control music, calls, and functions with a simple tap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"f7ntnc\" data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"784\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"737\"\u003eBuilt-in Microphone\u003c\/strong\u003e – Clear voice quality for calls and meetings\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1sz22y3\" data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"854\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"809\"\u003eSingle \u0026amp; Dual Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Use one or both earbuds as per your need\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"g5zfhw\" data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"929\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"874\"\u003eErgonomic Fit\u003c\/strong\u003e – Comfortable and secure for long listening sessions\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1jsvptw\" data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"997\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"958\"\u003eSweat-Resistant Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – Perfect for workouts and daily use\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1v9qucm\" data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1062\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1026\"\u003ePortable Charging Case\u003c\/strong\u003e – Easy charging anytime, anywhere\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"11djg2n\" data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1131\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1086\"\u003eLong Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – Extended usage with charging case backup\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-section-id=\"1hz4s1p\" data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1162\"\u003eAdditional Details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1344\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"9741mt\" data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1196\"\u003eCompact \u0026amp; lightweight design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1kbxqf4\" data-start=\"1197\" data-end=\"1233\"\u003eAuto-connect after first pairing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ttuwac\" data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1290\"\u003eCompatible with Android, iOS \u0026amp; all Bluetooth devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"zb1b6u\" data-start=\"1291\" data-end=\"1318\"\u003eCharging cable included\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ugwij\" data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1344\"\u003eEasy to use interface\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1472\"\u003eThe ZERO Flow Earbuds combine performance, comfort, and convenience — making them the perfect everyday audio companion.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Flame Black","offer_id":51210276012310,"sku":"24419","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Gray","offer_id":51210276045078,"sku":"24422","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pearl White","offer_id":51210276143382,"sku":"24423","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Black","offer_id":51210276077846,"sku":"24421","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Green Black","offer_id":51210276110614,"sku":"24420","price":4499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/01_8ae65121-2039-4166-8b07-11512d29eacd.webp?v=1776250201"},{"product_id":"wave-elite","title":"Wave Elite Zbuds","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"302\"\u003eThe Wave Elite Earbuds are designed for immersive sound, stable connectivity, and all-day convenience. Built with advanced Bluetooth 5.4 technology, ENC call noise reduction, ultra-low latency gaming mode, and long battery backup, they are the perfect choice for music, calls, gaming, and everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"1ma7m6t\" data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"319\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"474\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"350\"\u003ePremium Sound Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Powerful 13mm dynamic drivers deliver clear audio, rich bass, and balanced sound for an immersive listening experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"586\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"499\"\u003eENC Noise Reduction\u003c\/strong\u003e – Advanced call noise reduction minimizes background sounds for clearer voice calls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"718\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"618\"\u003eBluetooth 5.4 Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Enjoy faster pairing, strong wireless stability, and smooth connection with up to 10–15m range.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"843\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"748\"\u003eSensitive Touch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Effortlessly control music, calls, volume, and gaming mode with responsive touch gestures.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"961\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"870\"\u003eQuad Microphone Setup\u003c\/strong\u003e – Dual microphones in each earbud provide enhanced voice pickup and better call clarity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1087\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"990\"\u003eLow Latency Gaming Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Experience smooth and synchronized sound with ultra-fast 45ms latency for gaming and videos.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1192\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1116\"\u003eVoice Assistant Support\u003c\/strong\u003e – Instantly activate Siri or Google Assistant for hands-free convenience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1310\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1219\"\u003eIPX5 Water Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Sweat and splash resistant design makes them ideal for gym, workouts, and outdoor use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1384\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1329\"\u003eQuick Pairing\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fast and hassle-free connection after first setup.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1485\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1412\"\u003eComfortable In-Ear Fit\u003c\/strong\u003e – Ergonomic in-ear design ensures secure fit and long-lasting comfort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1490\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"18thdu9\" data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1513\"\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1602\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1542\"\u003e30 Hours Total Playtime\u003c\/strong\u003e – Long-lasting battery backup with charging case support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1681\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1638\"\u003e5 Hours Single Charge Playback\u003c\/strong\u003e – Reliable daily use on one full charge.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1778\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1683\" data-end=\"1707\"\u003e700mAh Charging Case\u003c\/strong\u003e – High-capacity charging case provides multiple recharges on the go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1868\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1807\"\u003e1–2 Hours Charging Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Quickly recharge earbuds and case for uninterrupted use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1938\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1894\"\u003eType-C Charging Port\u003c\/strong\u003e – Modern and convenient charging support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"2016\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1940\" data-end=\"1966\"\u003e100 Hours Standby Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Extended standby performance when not in use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2021\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"7o52ou\" data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2044\"\u003eAdditional Details\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2484\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1f2hjid\" data-start=\"2046\" data-end=\"2117\"\u003eBluetooth audio codec support for MP3, WMA, FLAC, WAV, APE and more\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"3tz66d\" data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2157\"\u003eAuto pairing after first connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1ozwnsi\" data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2193\"\u003eClear 32Ω balanced audio output\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1r98psv\" data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2245\"\u003eStylish lightweight design (40.5g total weight)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"djesr6\" data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2282\"\u003eAvailable in 5 attractive colors\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"wm71jn\" data-start=\"2283\" data-end=\"2363\"\u003eIncludes charging case, charging cable, user manual, warranty card \u0026amp; eartips\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1kiu9y5\" data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2407\"\u003eIncludes carrying pouch for portability\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1jp8vm0\" data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2484\"\u003eCompatible with Android, iPhone, tablets, laptops, and Bluetooth devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2489\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2491\" data-end=\"2654\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eThe Wave Elite Earbuds combine style, performance, and smart features — making them the ideal everyday audio companion for music lovers, gamers, and professionals.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black Ruby","offer_id":51249287102742,"sku":"23521","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Creamy Beige","offer_id":51249290445078,"sku":"23524","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Rose gold","offer_id":51249290510614,"sku":"23526","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue Breeze","offer_id":51249290412310,"sku":"23522","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Green Envy","offer_id":51249290477846,"sku":"23528","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/01_d4a07a8b-14fd-4911-baf6-1843bbdce0c2.webp?v=1777272712"},{"product_id":"open-zbuds","title":"Open Zbuds","description":"\u003cp data-end=\"465\" data-start=\"187\"\u003eThe Open Zbuds are designed for open-ear comfort, clear sound, and everyday convenience. Featuring an ergonomic ear-clip design, Bluetooth 5.4 connectivity, and reliable battery performance, they offer a perfect balance of awareness, comfort, and wireless freedom for daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"482\" data-start=\"467\" data-section-id=\"1ma7m6t\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"633\" data-start=\"484\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"508\" data-start=\"484\"\u003eOpen-Ear Clip Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – Unique ear-clip form factor ensures a secure fit without blocking the ear canal, keeping you aware of your surroundings.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"742\" data-start=\"635\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"661\" data-start=\"635\"\u003e10.8mm Dynamic Drivers\u003c\/strong\u003e – Large drivers deliver clear audio with balanced bass and crisp sound output.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"854\" data-start=\"744\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"774\" data-start=\"744\"\u003eBluetooth 5.4 Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fast pairing and stable wireless connection with a range of over 10 meters.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"947\" data-start=\"856\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"883\" data-start=\"856\"\u003eLow Latency Mode (60ms)\u003c\/strong\u003e – Smooth and synchronized audio for videos and casual gaming.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1045\" data-start=\"949\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"967\" data-start=\"949\"\u003eTouch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Easily manage music, calls, and functions with responsive touch gestures.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1137\" data-start=\"1047\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1072\" data-start=\"1047\"\u003eDual Microphone Setup\u003c\/strong\u003e – Built-in 2 microphones provide clear voice pickup for calls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1225\" data-start=\"1139\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1166\" data-start=\"1139\"\u003eVoice Assistant Support\u003c\/strong\u003e – Activate Siri or Google Assistant with a simple press.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1320\" data-start=\"1227\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1252\" data-start=\"1227\"\u003eIPX5 Water Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Sweat and splash resistant, ideal for workouts and outdoor use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1413\" data-start=\"1322\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1351\" data-start=\"1322\"\u003eAuto Pairing \u0026amp; Hyper Sync\u003c\/strong\u003e – Instantly connects after first use with seamless syncing.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1502\" data-start=\"1415\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1441\" data-start=\"1415\"\u003eMaster-Slave Switching\u003c\/strong\u003e – Use either earbud independently with flexible switching.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-end=\"1507\" data-start=\"1504\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"1530\" data-start=\"1509\" data-section-id=\"18thdu9\"\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1609\" data-start=\"1532\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1559\" data-start=\"1532\"\u003e15 Hours Total Playtime\u003c\/strong\u003e – Combined playback with charging case support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1695\" data-start=\"1611\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1649\" data-start=\"1611\"\u003e4.5 Hours Playback (Single Charge)\u003c\/strong\u003e – Reliable listening time on a full charge.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1777\" data-start=\"1697\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1721\" data-start=\"1697\"\u003e250mAh Charging Case\u003c\/strong\u003e – Compact case provides multiple recharges on the go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1847\" data-start=\"1779\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1804\" data-start=\"1779\"\u003e35 Hours Standby Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Efficient power usage when not in use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1913\" data-start=\"1849\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1870\" data-start=\"1849\"\u003e3 Hours Call Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Stable battery for calls and meetings.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1985\" data-start=\"1915\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1940\" data-start=\"1915\"\u003e2 Hours Charging Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fully recharge earbuds and case quickly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2067\" data-start=\"1987\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2011\" data-start=\"1987\"\u003eType-C Charging Port\u003c\/strong\u003e – Modern charging interface with 5V\/1A input support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-end=\"2072\" data-start=\"2069\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2096\" data-start=\"2074\" data-section-id=\"1khwwct\"\u003eAudio \u0026amp; Performance\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2188\" data-start=\"2098\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2130\" data-start=\"2098\"\u003eFrequency Range (20Hz–20KHz)\u003c\/strong\u003e – Full-range audio for a complete listening experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2268\" data-start=\"2190\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2207\" data-start=\"2190\"\u003e16Ω Impedance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Optimized balance of power efficiency and sound clarity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2348\" data-start=\"2270\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2291\" data-start=\"2270\"\u003e108dB Sensitivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Loud and clear audio output with minimal distortion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2442\" data-start=\"2350\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2377\" data-start=\"2350\"\u003eSBC \u0026amp; AAC Audio Support\u003c\/strong\u003e – Compatible with standard high-quality wireless audio codecs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-end=\"2447\" data-start=\"2444\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2466\" data-start=\"2449\" data-section-id=\"1jb9d1k\"\u003eSmart Controls\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2908\" data-start=\"2468\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2501\" data-start=\"2468\" data-section-id=\"1e74gz6\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2486\" data-start=\"2470\"\u003ePlay \/ Pause\u003c\/strong\u003e – Double tap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2551\" data-start=\"2502\" data-section-id=\"1jb3fi4\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2530\" data-start=\"2504\"\u003eAnswer \/ Hang Up Calls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Double tap (L\/R)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2602\" data-start=\"2552\" data-section-id=\"bbqlen\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2569\" data-start=\"2554\"\u003eReject Call\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold for 2 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2647\" data-start=\"2603\" data-section-id=\"1w3ttmt\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2619\" data-start=\"2605\"\u003eNext Track\u003c\/strong\u003e – Triple tap right earbud\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2695\" data-start=\"2648\" data-section-id=\"1lieurs\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2668\" data-start=\"2650\"\u003ePrevious Track\u003c\/strong\u003e – Triple tap left earbud\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2753\" data-start=\"2696\" data-section-id=\"1d0gkdn\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2717\" data-start=\"2698\"\u003eVoice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press left earbud for 3 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2806\" data-start=\"2754\" data-section-id=\"abdcgv\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2769\" data-start=\"2756\"\u003eGame Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press right earbud for 3 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2854\" data-start=\"2807\" data-section-id=\"7lggq5\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2821\" data-start=\"2809\"\u003ePower On\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold for 3 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2908\" data-start=\"2855\" data-section-id=\"vxd2k6\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-end=\"2870\" data-start=\"2857\"\u003ePower Off\u003c\/strong\u003e – Automatically when placed in case\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-end=\"2913\" data-start=\"2910\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-end=\"2936\" data-start=\"2915\" data-section-id=\"7o52ou\"\u003eAdditional Details\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"3279\" data-start=\"2938\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2982\" data-start=\"2938\" data-section-id=\"1l3hn9d\"\u003eLightweight design (~42.7g total weight)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3032\" data-start=\"2983\" data-section-id=\"1tdi5el\"\u003eCompact charging case (66.8 × 51.6 × 26.8 mm)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3067\" data-start=\"3033\" data-section-id=\"11pmc0z\"\u003eEarbud size: 32.8 × 23 × 25 mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3114\" data-start=\"3068\" data-section-id=\"f5l6bv\"\u003eEar-clip style ideal for long-term comfort\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3182\" data-start=\"3115\" data-section-id=\"13s9681\"\u003eCompatible with Android, iPhone, tablets, and Bluetooth devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3239\" data-start=\"3183\" data-section-id=\"m5l4fg\"\u003eIncludes earbuds (L\/R), charging case, and USB cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"3279\" data-start=\"3240\" data-section-id=\"1q3aj9v\"\u003eAvailable in Black and White colors\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-end=\"3284\" data-start=\"3281\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3457\" data-start=\"3286\"\u003eThe Open Zbuds combine comfort, awareness, and reliable performance — making them the ideal choice for users who prefer open-ear listening with modern wireless features.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"White Green","offer_id":51262197465366,"sku":"24565","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Orange","offer_id":51262197432598,"sku":"24140","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/02_ec8a7188-30ce-4a23-b32f-04e5bd0ddebf.webp?v=1777968648"},{"product_id":"halo-pro","title":"Halo Pro Headphones","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"481\"\u003eThe Halo Pro Headphones are designed for immersive audio, powerful noise cancellation, and long-lasting performance. Featuring hybrid ANC + ENC technology, large 40mm drivers, ultra-low latency, and extended battery life, they deliver a premium listening experience for music, calls, and everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"1ma7m6t\" data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"498\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"695\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"539\"\u003eHybrid ANC + ENC Noise Cancellation\u003c\/strong\u003e – Advanced active noise cancellation combined with environmental noise reduction minimizes external noise for a focused listening and calling experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"816\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"718\"\u003eDual 40mm Drivers\u003c\/strong\u003e – Equipped with powerful 2×40mm drivers for deep bass, clear vocals, and balanced sound output.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"921\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"848\"\u003eBluetooth 5.4 Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Stable and fast wireless connection with a range of up to 10 meters.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"1023\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"956\"\u003eUltra-Low Latency Mode (20ms)\u003c\/strong\u003e – Seamless audio synchronization for gaming and video streaming.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1128\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1053\"\u003ePhysical Button Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Easy and precise control over music, calls, volume, and ANC functions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1222\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1155\"\u003eIPX4 Water Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Resistant to sweat and light splashes, suitable for daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1310\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1246\"\u003eQuick Pairing Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Red and blue LED indicators guide fast and easy connection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1315\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"18thdu9\" data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1338\"\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1420\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1361\"\u003e45 Hours Playtime\u003c\/strong\u003e – Long-lasting battery life for uninterrupted listening.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1499\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1449\"\u003e500mAh Battery Capacity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Powerful built-in battery for extended usage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1577\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1526\"\u003e50 Hours Standby Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Efficient standby performance when not in use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1653\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1604\"\u003e4 Hours Charging Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fully recharge with Type-C charging support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1732\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1674\"\u003eType-C Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – Modern and reliable charging interface (DC 5V input).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"1734\" data-end=\"1737\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"1khwwct\" data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1761\"\u003eAudio \u0026amp; Performance\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1847\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1795\"\u003eFrequency Range (20Hz–20KHz)\u003c\/strong\u003e – Full-range audio for deep bass and crisp highs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1920\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1866\"\u003e32Ω Impedance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Balanced sound output with efficient power usage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1993\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1922\" data-end=\"1943\"\u003e105dB Sensitivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Loud and clear sound with minimal distortion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2073\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1995\" data-end=\"2017\"\u003e3 Microphone Setup\u003c\/strong\u003e – Enhanced voice clarity for calls and communication.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2168\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"2075\" data-end=\"2100\"\u003e-22dB Noise Reduction\u003c\/strong\u003e – Effective background noise suppression for better call quality.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2170\" data-end=\"2173\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"1jb9d1k\" data-start=\"2175\" data-end=\"2192\"\u003eSmart Controls\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2732\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"jvqds4\" data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2258\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2196\" data-end=\"2212\"\u003ePower On\/Off\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold power button for 3 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1tlx6uk\" data-start=\"2259\" data-end=\"2300\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2261\" data-end=\"2277\"\u003ePlay \/ Pause\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press power button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1vdv5mg\" data-start=\"2301\" data-end=\"2359\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2303\" data-end=\"2317\"\u003eNext Track\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold Volume + for 3 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1kuabcm\" data-start=\"2360\" data-end=\"2422\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2362\" data-end=\"2380\"\u003ePrevious Track\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold Volume – for 3 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"kzm9yj\" data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2472\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2425\" data-end=\"2443\"\u003eVolume Control\u003c\/strong\u003e – Tap Volume + \/ – buttons\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ucahzf\" data-start=\"2473\" data-end=\"2513\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2475\" data-end=\"2490\"\u003eAnswer Call\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press power button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"101am5u\" data-start=\"2514\" data-end=\"2559\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2516\" data-end=\"2531\"\u003eReject Call\u003c\/strong\u003e – Long press power button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1jzrfgp\" data-start=\"2560\" data-end=\"2612\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2576\"\u003eANC ON\/OFF\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press wave button for 3 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1dpk2m0\" data-start=\"2613\" data-end=\"2657\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2628\"\u003eGame Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Single press wave button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"iftlyf\" data-start=\"2658\" data-end=\"2732\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong data-start=\"2660\" data-end=\"2677\"\u003eFactory Reset\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold Volume + and Volume – for 5 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2737\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 data-section-id=\"7o52ou\" data-start=\"2739\" data-end=\"2760\"\u003eAdditional Details\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"3195\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1p2vn9c\" data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2808\"\u003ePremium over-ear wireless headphone design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"ldrgqs\" data-start=\"2809\" data-end=\"2865\"\u003eLightweight build (~221.5g) for comfortable long use\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1pw00nu\" data-start=\"2866\" data-end=\"2918\"\u003eErgonomic structure for better fit and stability\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1ukt9rp\" data-start=\"2919\" data-end=\"2979\"\u003eBluetooth protocol support for wide device compatibility\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1c0pp1i\" data-start=\"2980\" data-end=\"3030\"\u003eLED indicators for charging and pairing status\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1n1neu5\" data-start=\"3031\" data-end=\"3098\"\u003eCompatible with Android, iPhone, laptops, and Bluetooth devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"19256mj\" data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3148\"\u003eIncludes headphones and Type-C charging cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-section-id=\"1hhhy1b\" data-start=\"3149\" data-end=\"3195\"\u003eAvailable in Black, Green, and Gold colors\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr data-start=\"3197\" data-end=\"3200\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"3202\" data-end=\"3394\"\u003eThe Halo Pro Headphones combine powerful sound, intelligent noise cancellation, and long battery life — making them the perfect choice for users who want a premium wireless audio experience.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Rose gold","offer_id":51262216339734,"sku":"24160","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":51262216274198,"sku":"24159","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Matt Black","offer_id":51262216306966,"sku":"24158","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Army Green","offer_id":51262216241430,"sku":"24161","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Halo_Pro_1.webp?v=1777723827"},{"product_id":"jewel-pro","title":"Jewel Pro Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch1\u003eJewel Pro Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStylish and Durable Design\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted with a premium alloy body and a comfortable 18mm strap, the Jewel Pro carries a sleek 38.9mm dial while staying impressively light at just 29g. Built to handle daily life, it carries an IP68 water resistance rating so it keeps up with you through sweat, splashes, and rain.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVivid AMOLED Display\u003c\/strong\u003e Enjoy a larger 1.19-inch AMOLED screen with a sharp 390×390 resolution that delivers vibrant colors, deep contrast, and excellent clarity. With customizable menu view styles and an always-on display option, every glance feels premium.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReliable Battery Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e Powered by a 170mAh polymer battery, the Jewel Pro offers around 3 days of active use and up to 20 days on standby. Convenient magnetic wire charging tops it up fully in just 2 hours, getting you back on the move without delay.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Calling \u0026amp; NFC\u003c\/strong\u003e Take and make calls directly from your wrist thanks to the built-in speaker and Bluetooth calling chip. The integrated NFC support adds an extra layer of everyday convenience, keeping essential functions right at your fingertips.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathe Training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Consumption Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStay Connected\u003c\/strong\u003e Effortlessly manage calls, notifications, and alerts straight from your wrist. With contact synchronization, call records, incoming call and message alerts, split-screen functionality, and find-device\/find-phone tools, the Jewel Pro ensures you never miss an important moment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEveryday Tools\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your experience with 91+ cloud-based watch faces (around 6 built-in), animated watch faces, and DIY watch face support — and choose from 120+ sports modes (15–20 built-in). Additional smart tools include Siri voice assistant support, music playback and control through the watch speaker, camera control, weather updates, alarms, flashlight, calculator, LCD brightness adjustment, theater\/DND mode, motion gesture wake, theme modes, stopwatch\/countdown, the built-in 2048 game, OTA firmware upgrades, and helpful reminders for sedentary behavior, hydration, and low battery.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.19-inch AMOLED screen with 390×390 resolution.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 170mAh polymer battery — around 3 days active use, 20 days standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2 hours (magnetic wire charging).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68 rating for dependable durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOperating System:\u003c\/strong\u003e Compatible with Android 6.0+ and iOS 12+.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e BT3.0 \/ BLE 5.4 with a 25-meter transmission range.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e NFC support and Bluetooth calling.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMemory:\u003c\/strong\u003e 128M.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLanguages:\u003c\/strong\u003e 13 supported languages.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Jewel Pro Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Jewel Pro Smartwatch brings together refined design, a brilliant AMOLED display, and genuinely useful smart connectivity. With Bluetooth calling, NFC, comprehensive health tracking, and a deep set of everyday tools, it keeps you connected and in control — whether you're working out, powering through your day, or winding down at night.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Silver Gold Ring","offer_id":51268424925462,"sku":"24567","price":15999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Purple Ring","offer_id":51268424958230,"sku":"24571","price":15999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Ring","offer_id":51268424892694,"sku":"24569","price":15999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/ANGLE_01.webp?v=1782288247"},{"product_id":"klarity-zbuds","title":"Klarity Zbuds","description":"\u003ch1\u003eKlarity Zbuds – True Wireless Earbuds\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Klarity Zbuds are designed for immersive audio, intelligent noise cancellation, and all-day comfort. Featuring ENC technology, precision 10mm drivers, Bluetooth 5.4, and a compact charging case with extended battery life, they deliver a premium wireless audio experience for music, calls, and everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eENC Noise Cancellation\u003c\/strong\u003e – Environmental Noise Cancellation technology filters out background noise for cleaner, more natural call quality in any environment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e10mm Dynamic Drivers\u003c\/strong\u003e – Precision-tuned drivers deliver deep bass, clear vocals, and balanced sound for an immersive listening experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth 5.4 Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fast and stable wireless connection with a range of over 10 meters for uninterrupted audio.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLow Latency Mode (60ms)\u003c\/strong\u003e – Smooth audio-video synchronization for gaming, streaming, and video calls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTouch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Intuitive tap-based controls for music playback, calls, volume, and voice assistant — right at your fingertips.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIPX5 Water Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Sweat-proof and splash-resistant, built for workouts and everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAuto Pairing \u0026amp; Hyper Sync\u003c\/strong\u003e – Instant device recognition with seamless left-right earbud synchronization every time you open the case.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Pairing\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fast and easy connection with minimal setup.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant Support\u003c\/strong\u003e – Works with Siri and Google Assistant for convenient hands-free control.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e26 Hours Total Playtime\u003c\/strong\u003e – Up to 5.5 hours per charge, with the charging case delivering multiple top-ups for a total of 26 hours of listening.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e35mAh Earbud Battery\u003c\/strong\u003e – Efficient built-in battery in each earbud for consistent performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e400mAh Charging Case\u003c\/strong\u003e – Compact and powerful case that keeps your earbuds ready on the go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e40 Hours Standby Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Efficient power management for extended use between charges.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3.5 Hours Call Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Stay connected longer with optimized battery performance during calls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2 Hours Charging Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Quick and convenient recharge via Type-C cable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eType-C Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – Modern, reversible charging interface (5V \/ 1A input).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAudio \u0026amp; Performance\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFrequency Range (20Hz–20KHz)\u003c\/strong\u003e – Full-spectrum audio reproduction for deep lows and crisp highs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e26Ω Impedance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Efficient power delivery for clear, balanced sound output.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e108dB Sensitivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Rich, detailed audio with minimal distortion at any volume.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSBC \u0026amp; AAC Audio Decoding\u003c\/strong\u003e – Wide codec support for high-quality wireless audio across all devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e4-Microphone Setup\u003c\/strong\u003e – Dual mics per earbud for superior voice pickup during calls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSmart Controls\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePower On\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold for 3 seconds\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePower Off\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold for 8 seconds\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlay \/ Pause\u003c\/strong\u003e – Double-click either earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNext Track\u003c\/strong\u003e – Triple-click Right earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrevious Track\u003c\/strong\u003e – Triple-click Left earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVolume Up\u003c\/strong\u003e – Single-click Right earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVolume Down\u003c\/strong\u003e – Single-click Left earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer \/ Hang Up Call\u003c\/strong\u003e – Double-click Left or Right earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReject Call\u003c\/strong\u003e – Long press Left or Right earbud (2 seconds)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e – Long press Right earbud (3 seconds)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGame Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Long press Left earbud (3 seconds)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFactory Reset\u003c\/strong\u003e – Press and hold both earbuds simultaneously for 5 seconds while paired; device will power off once reset is successful\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAdditional Details\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompact in-ear true wireless design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTotal weight: 42.7g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eErgonomic fit with S\/M\/L ear tip sizes included\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth protocols: A2DP, AVCTP, AVDTP, AVRCP, HFP, SPP, RFCOMM, PNP, HID, SDP, L2CAP\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with Android, iPhone, laptops, and all Bluetooth devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncludes earbuds (L+R), charging case, Type-C charging cable, and S\/M\/L ear tips\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Orange, White, Green, Blue, and Red\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Klarity Zbuds combine powerful sound, smart noise cancellation, and an ultra-portable design — making them the perfect companion for music lovers, remote workers, and active users who demand a premium wireless audio experience.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Red Glassy","offer_id":51268421386518,"sku":"24413","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White Glassy","offer_id":51268421419286,"sku":"24414","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue Glassy","offer_id":51268421353750,"sku":"24412","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Beige Glassy","offer_id":51268421320982,"sku":"24411","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Klarity_4_19f547f1-f0bc-4846-b314-24e754ce2c28.webp?v=1779275470"},{"product_id":"10000mah-power-bank","title":"Voltix V-200 Power Bank","description":"\u003ch2\u003eVoltix V-200 Power Bank\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMetal Housing Build\u003c\/strong\u003e The Voltix V-200 is built with a solid metal housing that delivers a premium feel and dependable durability. At a compact 100×64.5×31.5mm and 314g, it's dense with power yet sized to travel comfortably in a bag, pocket, or glovebox.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e20000mAh Dual-Cell Battery\u003c\/strong\u003e Two Li-Polymer cells (NV 1376074) give the V-200 a full 20000mAh battery capacity with a matching 20000mAh rated capacity — real, usable power to keep your phone, earbuds, tablet, and accessories going through long days, flights, and weekends away.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e22.5W QC Fast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e QC fast charging support at 22.5W means compatible devices refill quickly instead of trickling along. Backed by the 04.0018017010001 main PCBA IC, power delivery stays consistent from the first percent to the last.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e20W PD Fast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e PD fast charging at 20W lets the V-200 push high-speed power to modern USB-C phones, tablets, and accessories — exactly the standard your newer devices are built around.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDual Output, Charge Two at Once\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C output delivers DC 5V\/3A, 9V\/2.22A, and 12V\/1.67A, while USB output covers DC 5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, 10V\/2.25A, and 12V\/1.5A. With both Type-C and USB outputs onboard, you can power two devices side by side.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eType-C Input Recharging\u003c\/strong\u003e Refill the V-200 through its Type-C input at DC 5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, or 12V\/1.5A — one modern cable, in and out, no adapters to hunt for.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Metal housing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Type:\u003c\/strong\u003e Li-Polymer cell\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eQuantity of Cell:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCell Number:\u003c\/strong\u003e NV 1376074\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMain PCBA IC:\u003c\/strong\u003e 04.0018017010001\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20000mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRated Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20000mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInput Voltage:\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C — DC 5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, 12V\/1.5A\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOutput Voltage:\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C — DC 5V\/3A, 9V\/2.22A, 12V\/1.67A; USB — DC 5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, 10V\/2.25A, 12V\/1.5A\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInput Ports:\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOutput Ports:\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C \u0026amp; USB\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eQC Supported:\u003c\/strong\u003e 22.5W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePD Supported:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 100×64.5×31.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 314g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose the Voltix V-200 Power Bank?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Voltix V-200 pairs a rugged metal housing with a genuine 20000mAh dual-cell battery and fast, flexible charging. With 22.5W QC and 20W PD support, dual Type-C and USB outputs, and a compact 314g frame, it's built for people who need real power without carrying a brick — commuters, travelers, and anyone who's tired of hunting for an outlet.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":51512764530966,"sku":"24639","price":9499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":51512764563734,"sku":"24649","price":9499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gradient Green","offer_id":51512764596502,"sku":"24650","price":9499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/1_1_7d4e6045-ad20-4846-8947-a806df24d135.webp?v=1783601752"},{"product_id":"regal-ai-pro-smartwatch-1","title":"Regal AI Pro Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eRegal AI Pro Smart Watch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1.19\" AMOLED Display with 360×360 Resolution\u003c\/strong\u003e A 1.19-inch AMOLED screen at 360×360p renders text, watch faces, and workout stats in deep contrast and rich color. Choose from 8 different menu view styles, adjust brightness on the fly, switch themes, or leave the always-on display running so the time is there the moment you glance down.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt-in ChatGPT \u0026amp; Voice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e The Regal AI Pro puts AI on your wrist. ChatGPT support plus voice assistant access means you can ask questions, get answers, and handle quick tasks without reaching for your phone.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth 5.3 Calling\u003c\/strong\u003e Powered by the JL7013A6 chipset with Bluetooth 5.3 and a 10-meter range, the built-in speaker and microphone let you take calls straight from your wrist. Sync your contact book, browse call records, and get incoming call, message, and app notifications the moment they land.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFull Health \u0026amp; Wellness Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e An HRS3600 sensor drives 24-hour heart rate monitoring alongside blood pressure, SpO2, and blood oxygen tracking. Sleep monitoring breaks down your night, stress tracking flags the tense days, and breathing training helps you reset. A DA267 accelerometer handles step counting and calorie tracking, and a dedicated menstrual cycle tracker rounds out the female health suite.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e100+ Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e Nine sports modes are built into the watch, with 100+ more available through the Zero Health app, covering running, cycling, indoor training, and far beyond. A sedentary reminder nudges you when you've been still too long, and a water reminder keeps you hydrated through the day.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e5-Day Battery, 15-Day Standby\u003c\/strong\u003e A 260mAh polymer battery delivers 3-5 days of everyday use and up to 15 days on standby, recharging in about 2.5 hours through the included USB magnetic cable. Just snap it on, no fiddling with ports.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIP68 Water Resistance \u0026amp; AiR Silicon Build\u003c\/strong\u003e An IP68 rating means rain, sweat, and hand-washing splashes are no problem. The AiR Silicon body keeps the whole watch at just 59.2g with a 44.52mm bezel dial and a 155.6×20mm strap that stays comfortable from morning to night.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e100+ Watch Faces, Plus Your Own\u003c\/strong\u003e Nine watch faces come preloaded, 100+ more wait in the Zero Health app, and DIY watch face support lets you set your own photo as the dial.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEverything Else You Reach For Daily\u003c\/strong\u003e A functional rotating crown makes navigation quick, and the essentials are all onboard: camera remote, music playback and control, weather updates, alarms, flashlight, calculator, stopwatch and countdown, theater\/DND mode, split screen, find my phone, find my device, gesture-to-wake, and three built-in games (Young Bird, Sudoku, and Hampster). Firmware stays current through OTA updates.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eModel: Regal AI Pro\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChipset: JL7013A6 (single chip)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eApp: Zero Health (Android \/ iOS)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisplay Size: 1.19 inch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eScreen Type: AMOLED\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResolution: 360×360p\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenu View Styles: 8 styles\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAndroid Requirement: 4.0 and above\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eiOS Requirement: 9.0 and above\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBezel Dial Dimensions: 44.52mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStrap Dimensions: 155.6 × 20mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBody Material: AiR Silicon\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight: 59.2g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance: IP68\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMemory: 128Mb\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Sensor: HRS3600\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAccelerometer \/ Pedometer: DA267\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpeaker: 1508\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Version: V5.3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Range: 10M\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Calling: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCrown \/ Encoder Function: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Type: Polymer battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Model: 851819\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 260mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Method: USB magnetic cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Time: 2.5 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWorking Time: 3-5 days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStandby Time: 15 days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWatch Faces: 9 built-in, 100+ cloud, DIY supported\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSports Modes: 9 built-in, 100+ cloud\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-in Games: 3 (Young Bird, Sudoku, Hampster)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFirmware Updates: OTA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDefault Language: English\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSupported Languages: Chinese, Traditional Chinese, English, German, Korean, Spanish, Japanese, French, Russian, Arabic, Ukrainian, Italian, Portuguese\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGPS: No\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNFC: No\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAnimated Watch Faces: No\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMusic Storage on Watch: No\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTWS Pairing: No\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThird-Party App Store Support: No\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eHealth Functions\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Pressure Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlood Oxygen Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathing Training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStress Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalorie Consumption\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSmart Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChatGPT\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoice Assistant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Calling \u0026amp; Call Records\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eContact Book Sync\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eText Message \u0026amp; Incoming Call Notifications\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMusic Playback via Watch Speaker\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMusic Control from Watch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCamera Control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeather Updates\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlarm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlashlight\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalculator\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStopwatch \/ Countdown\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTheater \/ DND Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSplit Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlways-On Display\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eScreen Brightness Adjustment\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTheme Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGesture Wake Display\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSedentary Reminder\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrink Water Reminder\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Battery Reminder\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFind My Device \/ Find My Phone\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Regal AI Pro?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Regal AI Pro brings a sharp 1.19\" AMOLED display, Bluetooth 5.3 calling, a full health sensor suite, and built-in ChatGPT together in a 59.2g IP68 body you can wear through workouts, work days, and sleep. With 3-5 days of battery, 100+ sports modes, 100+ watch faces, and a rotating crown that makes it all easy to reach, it's a smart watch for people who want their calls, their health data, and their AI assistant in one place, right on their wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":51405833306390,"sku":"23476","price":29999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Brown Gold","offer_id":51405833339158,"sku":"23475","price":29999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver Black","offer_id":51405833404694,"sku":"23473","price":29999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Green Gold","offer_id":51405833371926,"sku":"23477","price":29999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Green","offer_id":51405833273622,"sku":"23474","price":29999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/1_3_fab3da1c-eadf-4ddc-822b-e50eda55631a.webp?v=1786015100"},{"product_id":"wave-anc-zbuds","title":"Wave ANC Zbuds","description":"\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWave ANC Zbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"\u003eThe Wave ANC Zbuds are designed for immersive sound, stable connectivity, and all-day convenience. Built with advanced Bluetooth 5.4 technology, ENC call noise reduction, low-latency gaming mode, and reliable battery backup, they are the perfect choice for music, calls, gaming, and everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"[li_\u0026amp;]:mb-0 [li_\u0026amp;]:mt-1 [li_\u0026amp;]:gap-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePremium Sound Performance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Dynamic drivers deliver clear audio, rich bass, and balanced sound for an immersive listening experience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eENC Call Noise Reduction\u003c\/strong\u003e – Quad-mic ENC minimizes background noise for clearer voice calls (activate by tapping the right earbud 3 times).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTransparency Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Stay aware of your surroundings without removing the earbuds.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth 5.4 Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Faster pairing, strong wireless stability, and a smooth connection with up to 15m range.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSensitive Touch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Effortlessly control music, calls, volume, and game mode with responsive touch gestures.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eQuad Microphone Setup\u003c\/strong\u003e – Dual microphones in each earbud (4 total) for enhanced voice pickup and better call clarity.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLow Latency Gaming Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Smooth, synchronized sound with 65ms low-latency mode for gaming and videos (four-tap L\/R to switch game\/music mode).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant Support\u003c\/strong\u003e – Instantly activate Siri or Google Assistant (triple-tap the left earbud).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIPX5 Water Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Sweat and splash resistant design, ideal for gym, workouts, and outdoor use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eApp Support\u003c\/strong\u003e – Personalize the device name and settings via the companion app.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eQuick \u0026amp; Auto Pairing\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fast, hassle-free auto reconnection after the first setup.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSingle or Twin Use\u003c\/strong\u003e – Master–slave switching lets you use either earbud independently.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eComfortable In-Ear Fit\u003c\/strong\u003e – Ergonomic design ensures a secure fit and long-lasting comfort.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery \u0026amp; Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"[li_\u0026amp;]:mb-0 [li_\u0026amp;]:mt-1 [li_\u0026amp;]:gap-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUp to ~6 Hours Single-Charge Playback\u003c\/strong\u003e – Reliable daily use on one full charge.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e500mAh Charging Case\u003c\/strong\u003e – Provides multiple recharges on the go.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e2–2.5 Hours Charging Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Quickly recharge earbuds and case for uninterrupted use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e120 Hours Standby Time\u003c\/strong\u003e – Extended standby performance when not in use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdditional Details\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"[li_\u0026amp;]:mb-0 [li_\u0026amp;]:mt-1 [li_\u0026amp;]:gap-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003eWide audio decoding support: MP2, MP3, WMA, APE, FLAC, AAC, MP4, M4A, WAV, AIF, AIFC and more\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003eAuto pairing after first connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003eClear 32Ω balanced audio output (113dB ±1.5dB)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003eStylish lightweight design (38.5g total weight)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003eAvailable in multiple attractive colors\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003eIncludes earbuds, charging case, charging cable, eartips, user manual \u0026amp; warranty card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003eCompatible with Android, iPhone, tablets, laptops, and Bluetooth devices\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal\"\u003eThe Wave ANC Zbuds combine style, performance, and smart features — making them the ideal everyday audio companion for music lovers, gamers, and professionals.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Moonstone Beige","offer_id":51437744324886,"sku":"24321","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Cloud Black","offer_id":51437744259350,"sku":"24323","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Lava Black","offer_id":51437744292118,"sku":"24263","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/02_ae749eef-b121-4922-ad83-8de0a5c38621.webp?v=1781598874"},{"product_id":"gravity-pro-earbuds","title":"Gravity Pro Earbuds","description":"\u003ch2\u003eGravity Pro Earbuds Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStep into a world of immersive, true-wireless sound with \u003cstrong\u003eGravity Pro\u003c\/strong\u003e, earbuds built for people who want premium audio, all-day battery, and a clean, comfortable fit. Whether you're working, training, or commuting, Gravity Pro keeps you connected with crystal-clear sound and effortless controls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures of Gravity Pro Earbuds\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGravity Pro is packed with advanced features to elevate every listening session. The \u003cstrong\u003e13mm dynamic drivers\u003c\/strong\u003e deliver rich, full-range audio with deep bass and clear detail across a 20Hz–20KHz frequency range. With \u003cstrong\u003eboth ANC (Active Noise Cancellation) and ENC\u003c\/strong\u003e, background noise is shut out so you stay locked into your music — and a \u003cstrong\u003eTransparency Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e lets you tune back into your surroundings whenever you need to.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCalls stay crisp thanks to a \u003cstrong\u003e4-mic setup\u003c\/strong\u003e with up to \u003cstrong\u003e23dB call noise reduction\u003c\/strong\u003e. Smart \u003cstrong\u003ein-ear detection\u003c\/strong\u003e auto-pauses your audio when you remove an earbud, while \u003cstrong\u003eintuitive touch controls\u003c\/strong\u003e let you manage music, calls, volume, and your voice assistant (Siri \/ Google) with a tap. A dedicated \u003cstrong\u003eGame Mode with 60ms low latency\u003c\/strong\u003e keeps audio in sync with the action, and quick auto-pairing gets you connected in seconds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuilt tough with an \u003cstrong\u003eIPX5 water-resistant\u003c\/strong\u003e rating, Gravity Pro is ready for sweaty workouts and unpredictable weather.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications of Gravity Pro Earbuds\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDriver Size:\u003c\/strong\u003e 13mm dynamic drivers\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.4 (range \u0026gt;10m)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAudio Codecs:\u003c\/strong\u003e SBC, AAC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e Up to 5.5 hours (earbuds) + ~26 hours total with charging case\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Up to 40 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e ~2 hours | \u003cstrong\u003eInput:\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C (5V\/1A)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEarbud Battery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 35mAh | \u003cstrong\u003eCase Battery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 400mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNoise Control:\u003c\/strong\u003e ANC + ENC + Transparency Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMicrophone:\u003c\/strong\u003e 4 Mic, –38dB ±1dB\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IPX5\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/strong\u003e 32Ω | \u003cstrong\u003eSensitivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 115 ±1.5dB\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 48.5g (total) | \u003cstrong\u003eEarbud:\u003c\/strong\u003e 32.5×25×27mm | \u003cstrong\u003eCase:\u003c\/strong\u003e 66×47.6×26mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eColors:\u003c\/strong\u003e Black, Blue, Green\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCompatible with:\u003c\/strong\u003e iOS and Android\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIn the Box:\u003c\/strong\u003e Earbuds (L\/R), Charging Case, Eartips (L\/M\/S), USB-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose the Gravity Pro Earbuds?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing Gravity Pro means choosing a complete audio experience — powerful 13mm sound, dual ANC + ENC noise control, and a 4-mic system that keeps your calls clear anywhere. Add up to 26 hours of total playback, a secure in-ear fit, IPX5 durability, and a low-latency gaming mode, and you've got earbuds that keep up with every part of your day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Graphite Black","offer_id":51479303029014,"sku":"24407","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Glacier Blue","offer_id":51479302996246,"sku":"24406","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Seafoam Green","offer_id":51479303061782,"sku":"24405","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/3black_3dd3d127-7006-48b7-832b-35106b9de91b.webp?v=1786617375"},{"product_id":"nexus-pro-zbuds","title":"Nexus Pro Zbuds","description":"\u003ch1\u003eNexus Pro Zbuds\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeather-Light In-Ear Comfort\u003c\/strong\u003e Each Nexus Pro Zbud weighs just 3.7g, light enough that you forget you're wearing them. The in-ear design seals in comfortably with the included L and M eartips, and the whole set, buds plus charging case, comes in at only 41.4g in a compact 65.62×29.8×50mm shell that slips into any pocket.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e50 Hours of Total Playtime\u003c\/strong\u003e A 40mAh battery in each earbud delivers 6–7 hours of listening on a single charge, and the 800mAh charging case tops them back up again and again for 50 hours of total playtime. Leave them in the case and they hold a charge for up to 60 days of standby, so they're always ready when you are.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFast USB-C Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e Refill the case over modern USB-C at DC 5.0V, with a full charge in about 1.5 hours. A charging indicator keeps you informed at a glance, so you're never guessing how much power is left.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFF ANC Active Noise Cancellation\u003c\/strong\u003e Feed-forward Active Noise Cancellation cuts through engine drone, office chatter, and street noise, letting the music sit front and centre. When you need the world back, Transparency Mode opens things up instantly, no need to pull an earbud out for a quick conversation or an announcement.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e4-Mic Clear Calling\u003c\/strong\u003e Four silicone microphones across the set work together to lock onto your voice and push background noise into the background, so callers hear you and not everything around you.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth 5.4 with Jieli 7006\u003c\/strong\u003e Built on the Jieli 7006 platform, Bluetooth 5.4 with EDR+BLE delivers a stable connection up to 10 meters. Auto pairing connects the moment you open the case, master-slave switching lets either earbud run solo, and SBC and AAC decoding keep audio clean across a 20Hz–20KHz range.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFull Touch Control\u003c\/strong\u003e Sensitive touch panels on both earbuds handle everything, play and pause, skip forward and back, volume, calls, Siri or Google Assistant, and Game Mode for low-latency play, without ever reaching for your phone.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFive Colors to Choose From\u003c\/strong\u003e Available in Light Blue, Dark Green, Creamy White, Purple, and Black.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProduct Model: LY02\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eColors: Light Blue, Dark Green, Creamy White, Purple, Black\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEarphone Weight: 3.7g per earbud\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Case Dimension: 65.62mm × 29.8mm × 50mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTotal Weight: 41.4g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Input Type: USB-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharge Parameters: DC 5.0V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCase Input Power: 1.5W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCase Output Power: 1W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEarphone Battery Capacity: 40mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Case Battery Capacity: 800mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Supplier: Jinyuzhou\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTotal Play Time: 50 Hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlaying Time: 6–7 Hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStandby Time: 60 Days\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Time: 1.5 Hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWireless Charging (Case): No\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Platform: Jieli 7006\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Specification: BT5.4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConnection Way: EDR+BLE\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Distance: 10 Meters\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Protocols: A2DP, AVCTP, AVDTP, AVRCP, HFP, SPP, SMP, ATT, GAP, GATT, RFCOMM, SDP, L2CAP\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAuto Pairing: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaster\/Slave Switch: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEarphone Form: In-ear\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFrequency: 20Hz–20KHz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImpedance: 32Ω ±15%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSensitivity: -42±3dB\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAudio Decoding: SBC, AAC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicrophone: Silicone Mic, 4 Mic in set\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNoise Reduction: FF ANC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTransparency Mode: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoice Assistant: Siri \/ Google Assistant supported\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Indicator: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSensitive Touch: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance: Not rated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eTouch Controls\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlay \/ Pause: Single touch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAnswer Call: Single touch on left or right earbud\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHang Up: Single touch on left or right earbud\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReject Call: Long touch (2s) on left or right earbud\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSkip Back: Double touch on left earbud\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSkip Forward: Double touch on right earbud\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVolume +: Long touch (2s) on right earbud\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVolume −: Long touch (2s) on left earbud\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSiri \/ Google Assistant: Triple touch on left earbud\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGame Mode \/ Low Latency: Triple touch on right earbud\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBoost: Long touch (3s) on left or right earbud\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTurn Off: Long touch (5s) on left or right earbud\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFactory Reset: Touch L\/R earbud 4 times after taking the earbuds out of the case\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePackage Includes\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEarbuds (L\/R)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Case × 1\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEartips (L and M)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Cable × 1\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eColor Box × 1\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUser Manual × 1\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWarranty Card × 1\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Nexus Pro Zbuds?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Nexus Pro Zbuds pack the things that actually matter into 41.4g: 50 hours of total playtime, FF ANC with instant Transparency Mode, four microphones for calls people can hear, and Bluetooth 5.4 that connects the moment you flip the lid. Add USB-C fast charging, full touch control with Game Mode, and five colors to pick from, and you get earbuds built for commuters, students, gamers, and anyone who wants their music, calls, and quiet on demand, all day, every day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Milky White","offer_id":51479335010582,"sku":"23445","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":51479334945046,"sku":"23438","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Forest Green","offer_id":51479334879510,"sku":"23439","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Ice Blue","offer_id":51479334912278,"sku":"23441","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Lilac Purple","offer_id":51479334977814,"sku":"23443","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/05_3.webp?v=1785851137"},{"product_id":"lumin-l-200-power-bank","title":"Lumin L-200 Power Bank","description":"\u003ch2\u003eLumin L-200 Power Bank\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSturdy, Large-Capacity Design\u003c\/strong\u003e Built with an aluminum alloy and plastic body, the Lumin L-200 is engineered for people who need serious backup power. Measuring 145×67×28mm and weighing 460g, it feels solid in hand and holds up to the demands of travel, work trips, and long days off the grid.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e20000mAh Dual-Cell Battery\u003c\/strong\u003e Two high-grade polymer cells (1260110) deliver a full 20000mAh of capacity with a 12000mAh rated output, enough to recharge your phone several times over, plus your earbuds, tablet, and accessories, before you ever need an outlet.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e22.5W Fast Charging Output\u003c\/strong\u003e The USB-A port delivers up to 22.5W max (5V 4.5A \/ 5V 3A \/ 9V 2A \/ 12V 1.5A), while the USB-C port pushes 20W max (5V 3A \/ 9V 2.2A \/ 12V 1.5A). Powered by the IP5356F main PCBA IC, output stays fast, stable, and efficient across every device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQC \u0026amp; PD Support\u003c\/strong\u003e QC fast charging runs through Micro USB, USB-A1, and USB-A2, while PD fast charging is supported on USB-C, so whatever charging standard your device uses, the L-200 is ready for it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDual Input, Dual Output\u003c\/strong\u003e Refill through either Micro USB (5V 2A \/ 9V 2A \/ 12V 1.5A, 18W max) or USB-C (5V 3A \/ 9V 2A \/ 12V 1.5A, 18W max). Power your devices back out through USB-C and USB-A, charging two devices at once when you need to.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePD 20W Recharging\u003c\/strong\u003e Despite its 20000mAh capacity, the Lumin L-200 refills in around 4.5 hours with PD 20W fast charging, a full tank of power, ready before your next trip out the door.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e4 LED Indicators \u0026amp; Built-in LED Light\u003c\/strong\u003e Four LED indicators show remaining battery at a glance, so you always know where you stand. Four LED lights add everyday practicality whenever you need illumination on the move.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReady Out of the Box\u003c\/strong\u003e Every Lumin L-200 ships with a 30cm charging cable included, so it's good to go the moment you unbox it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Aluminum alloy + Plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Type:\u003c\/strong\u003e Polymer battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eQuantity of Cell:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2 pieces\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCell Number:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1260110\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMain PCBA IC:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP5356F\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20000mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRated Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 12000mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInput Voltage:\u003c\/strong\u003e Micro USB - 5V 2A \/ 9V 2A \/ 12V 1.5A (18W max); USB-C - 5V 3A \/ 9V 2A \/ 12V 1.5A (18W max)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOutput Voltage:\u003c\/strong\u003e USB-C - 5V 3A \/ 9V 2.2A \/ 12V 1.5A (20W max); USB-A - 5V 4.5A \/ 5V 3A \/ 9V 2A \/ 12V 1.5A (22.5W max)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInput Ports:\u003c\/strong\u003e Micro USB, USB-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOutput Ports:\u003c\/strong\u003e USB-C, USB-A\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eQC Supported:\u003c\/strong\u003e Micro USB \/ USB-A1 \/ USB-A2\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePD Supported:\u003c\/strong\u003e USB-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOperating Temperature:\u003c\/strong\u003e 60℃ (max)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNo. of LED Indicators:\u003c\/strong\u003e 4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLED Light:\u003c\/strong\u003e 4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 145×67×28mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 460g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Around 4.5 hours (PD 20W fast charging)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAccessories Included:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1pc 30cm charging cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSpecial Feature:\u003c\/strong\u003e Sturdy and large capacity design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose the Lumin L-200 Power Bank?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Lumin L-200 is built for anyone who refuses to run out of power. A rugged aluminum alloy shell, a 20000mAh dual-cell battery, 22.5W max output, QC and PD fast charging, and dual input and output ports come together in one dependable package, whether you're on a long flight, a weekend away, a busy work site, or simply nowhere near an outlet.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":51512770035990,"sku":"24652","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Dark Blue","offer_id":51512770068758,"sku":"24694","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Orange","offer_id":51512770101526,"sku":"24693","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/2_0055640f-51d0-4797-a2a5-4a7eaf204634.webp?v=1783595249"},{"product_id":"lumin-l-100-power-bank","title":"Lumin L-100 Power Bank","description":"\u003ch2\u003eLumin L-100 Power Bank\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSturdy and Slim Design\u003c\/strong\u003e Built with an aluminum alloy and plastic body, the Lumin L-100 pairs strength with a slim, travel-ready profile. At 145×67×16mm and 250g, it slips easily into a bag, pocket, or car console while staying tough enough for daily carry.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e10000mAh Polymer Battery\u003c\/strong\u003e Powered by a single high-grade polymer cell (1260110), the Lumin L-100 packs 10000mAh of capacity with a 6000mAh rated output, enough to keep your phone, earbuds, and accessories running through long days, commutes, and travel.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e22.5W Fast Charging Output\u003c\/strong\u003e The USB-A port delivers up to 22.5W max (5V 4.5A \/ 5V 3A \/ 9V 2A \/ 12V 1.5A), while the USB-C port pushes 20W max (5V 3A \/ 9V 2.2A \/ 12V 1.5A). Whether you're topping up a phone or a fast-charge-capable device, the L-100 keeps pace.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQC \u0026amp; PD Support\u003c\/strong\u003e QC fast charging is supported on Micro USB, USB-A1, and USB-A2, while PD fast charging runs through USB-C. Driven by the IP5356F main PCBA IC, power delivery stays stable and efficient across every port.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDual Input, Dual Output\u003c\/strong\u003e Recharge through either Micro USB (5V 2A \/ 9V 2A \/ 12V 1.5A, 18W max) or USB-C (5V 3A \/ 9V 2A \/ 12V 1.5A, 18W max). Power your devices back out through USB-C and USB-A, so you can charge and be charged, however you need.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Recharge Time\u003c\/strong\u003e With PD 20W fast charging, the Lumin L-100 refills in around 2.5 hours, no overnight wait before you head out again.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e4 LED Indicators \u0026amp; Built-in LED Light\u003c\/strong\u003e Four LED indicators keep you informed of remaining battery at a glance, and 4 LED lights add practical everyday utility when you need illumination on the go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReady Out of the Box\u003c\/strong\u003e Every Lumin L-100 ships with a 30cm charging cable included, so it's ready to use from the moment you unbox it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Aluminum alloy + Plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Type:\u003c\/strong\u003e Polymer battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eQuantity of Cell:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1 piece\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCell Number:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1260110\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMain PCBA IC:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP5356F\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 10000mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRated Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 6000mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInput Voltage:\u003c\/strong\u003e Micro USB - 5V 2A \/ 9V 2A \/ 12V 1.5A (18W max); USB-C - 5V 3A \/ 9V 2A \/ 12V 1.5A (18W max)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOutput Voltage:\u003c\/strong\u003e USB-C - 5V 3A \/ 9V 2.2A \/ 12V 1.5A (20W max); USB-A - 5V 4.5A \/ 5V 3A \/ 9V 2A \/ 12V 1.5A (22.5W max)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInput Ports:\u003c\/strong\u003e Micro USB, USB-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOutput Ports:\u003c\/strong\u003e USB-C, USB-A\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eQC Supported:\u003c\/strong\u003e Micro USB \/ USB-A1 \/ USB-A2\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePD Supported:\u003c\/strong\u003e USB-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOperating Temperature:\u003c\/strong\u003e 60℃ (max)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNo. of LED Indicators:\u003c\/strong\u003e 4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLED Light:\u003c\/strong\u003e 4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 145×67×16mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 250g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Around 2.5 hours (PD 20W fast charging)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAccessories Included:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1pc 30cm charging cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSpecial Feature:\u003c\/strong\u003e Sturdy and slim design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose the Lumin L-100 Power Bank?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Lumin L-100 brings together a durable aluminum alloy build, a slim everyday-carry profile, and genuinely fast power delivery. With 10000mAh of capacity, 22.5W max output, QC and PD fast charging, dual input and output ports, and a 2.5-hour recharge, it keeps you powered, whether you're commuting, traveling, or just away from an outlet longer than planned.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Orange","offer_id":51512771969302,"sku":"24692","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black","offer_id":51512771903766,"sku":"24691","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Dark Blue","offer_id":51512771936534,"sku":"24651","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/2_2_f85abbe5-55b5-4020-bb3d-69af5d9c915f.webp?v=1783593757"},{"product_id":"voltix-v-100-power-bank","title":"Voltix V-100 Power Bank","description":"\u003ch2\u003eVoltix V-100 Power Bank\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSlim Metal Housing\u003c\/strong\u003e The Voltix V-100 is wrapped in a solid metal housing that delivers a premium, cool-to-touch finish and everyday durability. At just 92.8×64.5×17mm and 172.6g, it's slim and light enough to disappear into a pocket, purse, or laptop sleeve without weighing you down.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e10000mAh Li-Polymer Battery\u003c\/strong\u003e A single high-grade Li-Polymer cell (NV 1376074) delivers a full 10000mAh battery capacity with a matching 10000mAh rated capacity, honest, usable power that keeps your phone, earbuds, and accessories running through a full day and beyond.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e22.5W QC Fast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e QC fast charging support at 22.5W means compatible devices refill quickly instead of trickling along. Backed by the 04.0018016010001 main PCBA IC, power delivery stays stable and efficient from the first percent to the last.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e20W PD Fast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e PD fast charging at 20W pushes high-speed power to modern USB-C phones, tablets, and accessories, the exact standard today's devices are built around.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDual Output, Charge Two at Once\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C output delivers DC 5V\/3A, 9V\/2.22A, and 12V\/1.67A, while USB output covers DC 5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, 10V\/2.25A, and 12V\/1.5A. With both Type-C and USB onboard, you can power two devices side by side.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eType-C Input Recharging\u003c\/strong\u003e Refill the V-100 through its Type-C input at DC 5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, or 12V\/1.5A, one modern cable, in and out, with no extra adapters to carry.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Metal housing\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Type:\u003c\/strong\u003e Li-Polymer cell\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eQuantity of Cell:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCell Number:\u003c\/strong\u003e NV 1376074\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMain PCBA IC:\u003c\/strong\u003e 04.0018016010001\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 10000mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRated Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 10000mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInput Voltage:\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C - DC 5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, 12V\/1.5A\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOutput Voltage:\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C - DC 5V\/3A, 9V\/2.22A, 12V\/1.67A; USB - DC 5V\/3A, 9V\/2A, 10V\/2.25A, 12V\/1.5A\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInput Ports:\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOutput Ports:\u003c\/strong\u003e Type-C \u0026amp; USB\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eQC Supported:\u003c\/strong\u003e 22.5W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePD Supported:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e 92.8×64.5×17mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 172.6g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose the Voltix V-100 Power Bank?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Voltix V-100 brings together a premium metal build, a genuine 10000mAh Li-Polymer battery, and fast, flexible charging in a remarkably slim frame. With 22.5W QC and 20W PD support, dual Type-C and USB outputs, and a pocket-friendly 172.6g body, it's made for people who want real backup power that never feels like extra baggage, commuters, students, travelers, and anyone living away from an outlet.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":51512772755734,"sku":"24638","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gradient Blue","offer_id":51512772788502,"sku":"24648","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":51512772821270,"sku":"24647","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/2_1_b5235464-2f59-4ac5-a0d4-752c06e7d1d8.webp?v=1783601186"},{"product_id":"pakistan-edition","title":"Pakistan Edition Z BUDS","description":"\u003ch1\u003ePakistan Edition Limited Edition Earbuds\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCelebrate a moment of national pride with the \u003cstrong\u003ePakistan Edition Limited Edition Earbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e. Inspired by the Pakistan Air Force's historic 6-0 victory, this special edition combines a premium design with reliable everyday performance. Whether you're listening to music, attending calls, watching videos, or gaming, these earbuds deliver clear sound, stable connectivity, and all-day comfort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🎧 \u003cstrong\u003eLimited Edition Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – A commemorative design inspired by one of Pakistan's most memorable achievements, created for those who appreciate both performance and national pride.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔊 \u003cstrong\u003eClear \u0026amp; Balanced Sound\u003c\/strong\u003e – Enjoy crisp vocals, rich bass, and an immersive listening experience. Quad-mic ENC technology helps reduce background noise for clearer voice calls.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong\u003eLong Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – Get up to 5–6 hours of playback on a single charge and up to 20–24 hours with the charging case.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong\u003eFast USB-C Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – Recharge the earbuds and case in just 1–2 hours using the USB-C charging port.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔗 \u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth 5.4 Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Experience a fast, stable, and low-latency wireless connection with support for AAC and SBC audio codecs and a range of over 10 metres.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🎮 \u003cstrong\u003eLow Latency Game Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e – Switch to Game Mode with four quick taps for a more responsive gaming experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🎙 \u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant Support\u003c\/strong\u003e – Instantly access Siri or Google Assistant with a simple touch.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🖐 \u003cstrong\u003eSmart Touch Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Easily control music, calls, volume, and other functions without reaching for your phone.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e💧 \u003cstrong\u003eIPX4 Water Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e – Designed to withstand sweat and light splashes, making them ideal for workouts and everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 45 g (Earbuds + Charging Case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Capacity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 40 mAh × 2 (Earbuds) + 700 mAh (Charging Case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlayback Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–6 Hours (Single Charge) | Up to 20–24 Hours (With Charging Case)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStandby Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 120 Hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1–2 Hours (5V \/ 300mA)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.4\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWireless Range:\u003c\/strong\u003e More than 10 Metres\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAuto Pairing:\u003c\/strong\u003e Yes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAudio Codecs:\u003c\/strong\u003e AAC, SBC\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFrequency:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2.4 GHz\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImpedance:\u003c\/strong\u003e 32Ω ±10%\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSensitivity:\u003c\/strong\u003e 105 ±3 dB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMicrophones:\u003c\/strong\u003e Quad-Mic ENC Noise Reduction\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IPX4\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eTouch Controls\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlay \/ Pause:\u003c\/strong\u003e Single tap on either earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNext Track:\u003c\/strong\u003e Double tap the right earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrevious Track:\u003c\/strong\u003e Double tap the left earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVolume Up:\u003c\/strong\u003e Triple tap the right earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVolume Down:\u003c\/strong\u003e Triple tap the left earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVoice Assistant:\u003c\/strong\u003e Press and hold either earbud for 2 seconds\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGame Mode:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tap either earbud four times\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnswer \/ End Call:\u003c\/strong\u003e Double tap either earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReject Call:\u003c\/strong\u003e Double tap either earbud\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePower Off:\u003c\/strong\u003e Touch and hold for 7 seconds\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose Pakistan Edition Earbuds?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003ePakistan Edition Limited Edition Earbuds\u003c\/strong\u003e are designed for users who want dependable performance with a unique commemorative design. From daily commutes and office calls to workouts and gaming sessions, they provide clear audio, reliable Bluetooth connectivity, long battery life, and comfortable all-day wear. If you're looking for earbuds that combine practical features with a design inspired by a proud national moment, the Pakistan Edition is the perfect choice.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Pak Edition Gift Box","offer_id":51616079511830,"sku":"25747","price":9999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/4_707e1a7e-2ef4-4fdb-a461-0a9e5a11c316.webp?v=1785505401"},{"product_id":"arcade-nitro-zbuds","title":"Arcade Nitro Zbuds","description":"\u003ch1\u003eArcade Nitro Zbuds\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e10mm Drivers for Full, Punchy Sound\u003c\/strong\u003e A 10mm audible unit in each earbud pushes deep low end and clear highs across a full 20Hz to 20KHz range. With 16Ω impedance and 93dB sensitivity, the Arcade Nitro Zbuds run loud and clean off any phone or tablet, and SBC and AAC decoding keeps the signal faithful from track to ear.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFF ANC with Transparency Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e Feed-forward Active Noise Cancellation quiets engine hum, office chatter, and crowd noise so your audio stays front and centre. One long touch cycles you through Transparency, ANC, and Normal, so you can let the outside world back in for an announcement or a quick conversation without taking an earbud out.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eENC Noise Reduction for Calls\u003c\/strong\u003e Silicon microphones with ENC call noise reduction lock onto your voice and hold back the background, so the person on the other end hears you instead of the street behind you.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e15 Hours of Total Playtime\u003c\/strong\u003e A 40mA battery in each earbud gives you 5 hours of listening per charge, and the 450mA charging case brings that up to 15 hours of total playtime. Standby runs to 70 hours, and a full recharge over Type-C takes about 2 hours. A charging indicator shows you where you stand at a glance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIPX4 Water Resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e An IPX4 rating handles sweat, splashes, and light rain, so gym sessions, runs, and unexpected weather are not a problem.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth 5.4 with Jieli 7006F8\u003c\/strong\u003e Built on the Jieli 7006F8 platform, Bluetooth 5.4 holds a stable connection out to 10 meters. Quick Pairing gets you connected fast, master-slave switching lets either earbud run solo when you only need one in, and Siri or Google Assistant is a long touch away.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMulti-Functional Touch Button\u003c\/strong\u003e An MFB touch control on each earbud handles the whole set: play and pause, next and last track, volume up and down, answering, rejecting, and ending calls, voice assistant, and switching between ANC, Transparency, and Normal. Your phone can stay in your pocket.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompact Case, Three Colors\u003c\/strong\u003e The 58.02 x 58.02 x 28.83mm case is small enough to vanish into a pocket, and the whole set weighs just 48g. Available in Black, White, and Green.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProduct Model: G39A\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eColors: Black, White, Green\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEarphone Dimensions: 24.31 x 21.67 x 32.78mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Case Dimensions: 58.02 x 58.02 x 28.83mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTotal Weight: 48g\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEarphone Form: TWS in-ear\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Input Type: Type-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharge Parameters: 4.2V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCase Input Power: 2Wh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCase Output Power: 0.4Wh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEarphone Battery Capacity: 40mA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Case Battery Capacity: 450mA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Supplier: Yideng and Xindian\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTotal Play Time: 15 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlaying Time: 5 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStandby Time: 70 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Time: 2 hours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater Resistance: IPX4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAudible Unit: 10mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFrequency: 20Hz to 20KHz\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImpedance: 16Ω\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSensitivity: 93dB\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAudio Decoding: SBC, AAC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicrophone: Silicon Microphone, 2 Mic in set\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCall Noise Reduction: ENC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNoise Cancellation Type: FF ANC + ENC\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTransparency Mode: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Platform: Jieli 7006F8\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Specification: 5.4\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Distance: 10m\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConnection Way: Wireless\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBluetooth Protocols: A2DP, AVCTP, AVDTP, AVRCP, HFP, SPP, SMP, ATT, GAP, GATT, RFCOMM, SDP, L2CAP\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuick Pairing: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaster\/Slave Switch: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoice Assistant: Siri \/ Google Assistant supported\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Indicator: Yes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTouch Control: Multi-Functional Touch Button (MFB)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWireless Charging (Case): No\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAuto Pairing: No\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePopup Pairing: No\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn-Ear Detection: No\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eTouch Controls\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlay \/ Pause: Click R or L after connecting your phone and opening the music app\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLast Song: Double click L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNext Song: Double click R\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVolume +: Click R\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVolume -: Click L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAnswer Call: Double click\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReject Call: Double click\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHang Up: Single click\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSiri \/ Google Assistant: Long touch left for 3 seconds\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTransparency \/ ANC \/ Normal: Long touch right for 3 seconds to switch to Transparency, again for ANC, again for Normal\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTurn Off: Long touch R or L for 5 seconds to turn off each earbud separately\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFactory Reset: Long touch R or L for 5 seconds to turn the earbuds off, then long touch both touch panels for 5 seconds. The red light blinks 5 times and the earbuds switch off.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePackage Includes\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEarbuds (L\/R)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Case\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEartips\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Arcade Nitro Zbuds?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Arcade Nitro Zbuds put 10mm drivers, FF ANC with instant Transparency Mode, and ENC call clarity into a 48g set that costs you nothing in pocket space. Bluetooth 5.4 keeps the connection solid, IPX4 handles sweat and rain, 15 hours of total playtime carries you through the day, and a single touch button runs everything without your phone. Music, calls, and quiet, all on demand.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Battle Green","offer_id":51634997788950,"sku":"23437","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Neon White","offer_id":51634997821718,"sku":"23435","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Phantom Black","offer_id":51634997854486,"sku":"23433","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/5green.webp?v=1785759493"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/collections\/best-offers-2_1b0484e7-6b6a-486f-9543-a34f5edc15c7.webp?v=1782288021","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/collections\/best-seller.oembed?page=2","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}